<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="DEU" style="id">- Gofa Full Bible Latin Version Final</book>
  <para style="h">Zaaretho Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Zaaretho Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Zaare</para>
  <para style="toc2">Zaaretho</para>
  <para style="mt1">Zaaretho Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="imt">Gaatha Qofa</para>
  <para style="ip">“Zaaretho Maxaafa” geetetiya ha maxaafay, Isra7eele asay daro wode mela biittan hemetidaape guye, Kanaane gakanaw guuthu attishin, Moo7abe biittan gam7ida wode ubban, Musey hayqanaape sinthe, zaari zaari entaw odida oda oykis.</para>
  <para style="ip">Musey ha maxaafa Isra7eele asaas zaaridi xaafida gisho ha maxaafay, “Zaaretho Woga” geetetidi sunthetis.</para>
  <para style="ip">Musey, aadhida oytamu laythata giddon poletida, gita gita oosota hassayidi odees. Xoossay enta mela biittan waatidi kaalethidaako asaa hassaysidi, enti Xoossas ammanetida asi gidana melanne suuretethan kiitetana mela qofisees.</para>
  <para style="ip">Musey tammu kiitata zaari zaari odidi, koyro kiita birshetha entaw qoncisis. Asay Xoossa xalaala goyinnana mela hassaysees. Iyara gathidi, Isra7eele asay ufaysi oothida biittan aqana dumma dumma ayso woga odis. Musey, Xoossay entara caaqida caaqoy ay meleko entaw birshidi, enti he caaquwa oorathidi ammanetana mela enta qofisees.</para>
  <para style="ip">Iyyasuy, Muse bessan shuumetidi Xoossa asa kaalethiya asi gidis. Musey, Xoossay ammanetiya Xoosse gideysa sabbanaw keydi, mazmure yexidaapenne Isra7eele kocha ubba anjidaape guye, Yordaanose shaafape doloha baggan de7iya Moo7abe biittan hayqis.</para>
  <para style="ip">Maxaafa ayfe qofay, Xoossay ba siiquwan doorida ba asa ashshidaysanne anjidaysa odees. Xoossa anjoy entafe shaaketonna de7on daana mela Xoossay entaw oothidaba ubbaa akeekisees. Enti ubba wode Xoossa dosana melanne iyaw kiitetana mela enta zorees.</para>
  <para style="ip">Maxaafa waanna qofa oykida xiqisey, Yesuusi “Kiita ubbaafe aadhiya kiita” yaagidi odida qaala oykida (6:4-6) kifiliya. Hessika, “Neno, Isra7eele si7a; Goday nu Xoossay issi Xoossi. Godaa, ne Xoossa ne kumetha wozanape, ne kumetha shempuwafenne ne kumetha wolqafe dosa” yaagees. Ha kifiley Isra7eele kawotethay kumethi woossiya eretida woosa kifile.</para>
  <para style="iot">Maxaafa Ayfe Qofata</para>
  <para style="io1">Musey beni aadhida taarike qofisees <char style="ior">(<ref loc="DEU 1:1-4:49">1:1—4:49</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xoossi asape koyey aybeko Musey akeekisees <char style="ior">(<ref loc="DEU 5:1-28:68">5:1—28:68</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Asay banta caaqida qaala polanaw bessees <char style="ior">(<ref loc="DEU 29:1-30:20">29:1—30:20</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Iyyasuy asa kaalethanaw shuumetetha <char style="ior">(<ref loc="DEU 31:1-13">31:1-13</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Asay Xoossa dogana <char style="ior">(<ref loc="DEU 31:14-29">31:14-29</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Muse mazmure <char style="ior">(<ref loc="DEU 31:30-32:47">31:30—32:47</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Musey biitta be7is; Isra7eele kocha anjis <char style="ior">(<ref loc="DEU 32:48-33:29">32:48—33:29</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Muse hayquwa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="DEU 34:1-12">34:1-12</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="DEU 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Isra7eeleti Siinape Dendidosona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 1:1"/>Ha maxaafan xaafetida qaala ubbay Yordaanose shaafape hefinthan de7iya mela biittan enti de7ishin, Musey Isra7eele asaas odida qaala. He wode enti Suufape sintha baggara Paarana katamaas issi baggara, qassi Tofeela, Laabana, Haxerootanne Dizaaba katamata giddon de7iya Yordaanose zangaaran de7oosona. <verse eid="DEU 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 1:2"/>Sayre deriya baggara Koreeba zumaape bidi Qaades-Barne gakanaw tohon tammanne issi gallasa oge.<verse eid="DEU 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 1:3"/>Gibxefe enti keyida oytamantho laythan, tammanne issintho ageenan, koyro gallasan, Goday entaba Muse kiittidaba ubbaa Isra7eele asaas odis. <verse eid="DEU 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 1:4"/>Hessi haniday Haseboona kataman kawotidi Amooreta haariya Sihoonanne Astarootaninne Edraa7an kawotidi Baasane haariya Ooge, Musey xoonidaape guyena.<verse eid="DEU 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 1:5"/>Asay Yordaanosepe doloha baggara, Moo7aben de7ishin, Musey ha higgiya haysada yaagidi entaw qoncisethi doomis.<verse eid="DEU 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 1:6"/>Nuuni Koreeba Zumaa bolla de7ishin, Goday, nu Xoossay nuuko haysada yaagis. “Hinte ha deriya bolla daro gam7ideta. <verse eid="DEU 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 1:7"/>Dunkaaniya laallite; dendidi derey dariya Amooreta biittanne Araban de7iya enta yuushuwan de7iya biitta ubbaa biite. Hessika Yordaanose zangaara, gezzenne gadha biitta, Negebanne Medetiraane Abbaa gaxa aadhite. Kanaane biitta biite; Libaanose dereta kanthidi, Efraxiisa Shaafa gakanaw biite. <verse eid="DEU 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 1:8"/>Heko, taani hintew ha biitta immas. Bidi hinte aawatas, Abrahaames, Yisaaqas, Yayqoobasinne enta sheeshas immanaw Goday caaqida biitta laattite” yaagis.<verse eid="DEU 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Musey Halaqata Shuumis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 18:13-27">Kessa 18:13-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 1:9"/>Musey asaako, “He wode taani hintew haysada yaagada odas; taani tarka hintena tookanaw danda7ike. <verse eid="DEU 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 1:10"/>Goday, hinte Xoossay hinte taybuwa salo xoolintoda darsis. <verse eid="DEU 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 1:11"/>Goday hinte aawata Xoossay, hintena haysafe aathidi mukulu toho gujidi darsonne I gidaysada hintena anjo. <verse eid="DEU 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 1:12"/>Shin hinte metuwa, hinte toohuwanne hinte ooshsha ubbaa taani tarka waata tookanaw danda7ayna? <verse eid="DEU 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 1:13"/>Hinte kochatape cinca, akeekanchonne bonchetida asata doorite; taani hinte bolla enta halaqa oothana” yaagis.<verse eid="DEU 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 1:14"/>Hinte zaaridi, “Ne qofay lo77o” yaagideta. <verse eid="DEU 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 1:15"/>Hessa gisho, taani hinte kochaafe cincanne bonchetida asata ekada, shaalaqa, mato halaqa, hamsalaqanne asiralaqa, hintena ayseysata oothada hinte bolla shuumas.<verse eid="DEU 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 1:16"/>Taani enta, “Hinte ishata giddon de7iya odaa si7ite; he oday issi Isra7eele asaapenne iya ishaape giddon woyko Isra7eele asaapenne hara dere asape giddon de7iyaba gidikoka, odaa si7idi suure pirdite. <verse eid="DEU 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 1:17"/>Pirdi Xoossaba gidiya gisho, hinte pirdan issi baggaa maaddofite; gitaa si7eysada guuthaa si7ite; asa som7os yayyofite. Daro deexo gidida odata taako ehite; hessa taani si7ana.” <verse eid="DEU 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 1:18"/>Hinte oothanaba ubbaa ta he wode hintena kiittana.<verse eid="DEU 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kanaane Wochanaw Kiitetida Asata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 13:1-33">Taybo 13:1-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 1:19"/>Hessafe guye, “Nuuni Koreeba zumaape dendida; Goday nu Xoossay nuna kiittidaysada, derey dariya Amooreta biitta biya ogen de7iya he hinte be7ida gitanne yashshiya mela biitta kanthidi Qaades-Barne gakida. <verse eid="DEU 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 1:20"/>Goday nu Xoossay nuna laatisiya, derey dariya Amooreta biittay haysa. <verse eid="DEU 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 1:21"/>Goday hinte Xoossay ha biitta hintew immis. Goday hinte aawata Xoossay hintew odidaysada keyidi, ha biitta laattite; yayofite; ufaysi qanxofite” yaagas.<verse eid="DEU 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 1:22"/>Hinte ubbay taako yidi, “He biitta xomoosidi, nu baanaw bessiya ogiyabanne gelana katamata hanota new ehiya asata nuupe sinthe yeddoos” yaagideta.<verse eid="DEU 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 1:23"/>He qofay taw lo77o daanin, hintefe tammanne nam7u asi, kochaafe kochaafe issi asi dooras. <verse eid="DEU 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 1:24"/>Enti bidi, he derey dariya biitta kanthidi, Eshkola zangaara gakanaw de7iya biitta wochidosona. <verse eid="DEU 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 1:25"/>He biittan doliyabape guutha ayfe banta kushen oykidi nuuko yidosona. Qassi, “Goday nu Xoossay nuus immiya biittay lo77o biitta” giya wore ekidi yidosona.<verse eid="DEU 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 1:26"/>Shin hinte Godaa hinte Xoossaa kiitta ixas gidi yaa boonna ixideta. <verse eid="DEU 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 1:27"/>Hinte dunkaaniya giddon issoy issuwara haysada yaagidi zuuzumideta. “Goday nuna ixida gisho, dhaysanaw Amoore biitta asata kushen aathidi immanaw Gibxe biittafe kessis. <verse eid="DEU 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 1:28"/>Yaatin yaa ayis baanee? Nu ishati, ‘He biittan de7iya asati nuupe daroosonanne aduqosona. Katamatika gitanne salo gakanaw gimbetidaysata. Hessa bolla qassi Anaaqe geetetiya daro adussa asata yan be7ida’ yaagidi, nu wozana til7isidosona” yaagideta.<verse eid="DEU 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 1:29"/>Yaatin taani, “Yayyofite woyko dagammofite. <verse eid="DEU 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 1:30"/>Hinte sinthara biya Goday hinte Xoossay kase Gibxen hinte ayfiya sinthan hintew oothidaysada ha77ika hintew I oletana. <verse eid="DEU 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 1:31"/>Qassi hinte ha mela biitta gakanaw yida oge ubban asi ba na7a tookeysada Goday hinte Xoossay hintena tookidaysa be7ideta” yaagas.<verse eid="DEU 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32-33" style="v" sid="DEU 1:32-33"/>Ha ubbay haninka, hinte dunkaanana bessaanne hinte baana ogiya bessanaw qamma tama tuussan, gallas shaara tuussan hintena kaalethida Godaa hinte Xoossaa ammanibeketa.<verse eid="DEU 1:32-33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 1:34"/>“Goday hinte haasaya si7idi hanqetis; haysada yaagidi caaqis; <verse eid="DEU 1:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 1:35"/>taani hinte mayzatas immana gada caaqida ha lo77o biitta, ha iita yeletethaafe issoyka be7enna. <verse eid="DEU 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 1:36"/>Ha biitta be7anay Yoofona na7aa Kaaleba xalaala. I yedhida biitta iyasinne iya kochaas immana; I ba kumetha wozanaape Godaa kaallis” yaagidi caaqis.<verse eid="DEU 1:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 1:37"/>Hinte gaason Goday ta bollaka hanqetidi, haysada yaagis; “Hari attoshin, neka he biitta gelaka. <verse eid="DEU 1:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 1:38"/>Shin nena maaddiya Nawe na7ay, Iyyasuy he biitta gelana. I Isra7eele asaa he biittaa laatisanaw de7iya gisho neeni iya minthetha. <verse eid="DEU 1:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 1:39"/>Hinte, nu nayti di7etana gida guuthati, iitanne keeha shaakidi eronna hinte nayti he biitta gelana. Taani he biitta entaw immana; entika laattana. <verse eid="DEU 1:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 1:40"/>Shin hinte guye simmidi, Zo7o Abbaa efiya ogiya oykidi, mela biitta biite” yaagis.<verse eid="DEU 1:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 1:41"/>Hinte zaaridi, “Nuuni Godaa bolla nagara oothida; ha77i nuuni Goday nu Xoossay kiiteysada, keyidi oletana” yaagideta. Hinte ubbay ola miishe dancidi, derey dariya biitta keyidi oletanaysa laafaba oothidi qopideta.<verse eid="DEU 1:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 1:42"/>Shin Goday taako, “Taani entara doonna gisho, enti keyidi oletona mela oda. Akay, giiko, enta morketi enta xoonana” yaagis. <verse eid="DEU 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 1:43"/>Yaagin, taani hintew odas, shin hinte Godaa kiitta ixidetape attishin, ta odeysa si7ibeeketa; yaatidi otoron derey dariya biitta keydeta. <verse eid="DEU 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 1:44"/>He derey dariya biittan de7iya Amooreti hintera ola gahetidi, hintena mathi gooddeysada gooddidi, Sayre biittafe bidi Horma gakanaw shocidosona. <verse eid="DEU 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 1:45"/>Hinte guye simmidi, Godaako yeekideta; shin Goday hinte yeehuwa si7ibeenna woyko hayzibeenna. <verse eid="DEU 1:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 1:46"/>Hessa gisho, hinte Qaadesan adussa wode gam7ideta.<verse eid="DEU 1:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="DEU 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Mela Biittan Bixatida Wodeta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 2:1"/>Hessafe guye, Goday tana kiittidaysada, nuuni Zo7o Abbaa efiya ogiya oykidi guye simmidi mela biitta metootishe, derey dariya Sayre biittan daro gallasa toylatishe yuuyida.<verse eid="DEU 2:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 2:2"/>Hessafe guye, Goday taako haysada yaagis. <verse eid="DEU 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 2:3"/>“Ha derey dariya biitta adussa wode yuuyidaysi hintew gidana; pudeha bagga simmidi biite. <verse eid="DEU 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 2:4"/>Asaa neeni yaagada kiitta; ‘Sayren de7ey Eesawe nayta hinte ishata gidiya gisho enta biittara hinte kantheeta. Enti hintew yayyana, shin hinte keehi naagetite. <verse eid="DEU 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 2:5"/>Taani enta biittafe tohoy yedhiya bessa mela hintew immonna gisho entara oletofite. Taani derey dariya Sayre biitta laata oothada Eesawes koyrottada immas. <verse eid="DEU 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 2:6"/>Hinte miya kathaanne uyaa haatha entafe miishen shammite’ ” yaagada kiitta.<verse eid="DEU 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 2:7"/>Goday hinte Xoossay hinte oothidaba ubbaa anjis; hinte ha wolqaama mela biittan hemetiya wode hintena naagis. Oytamu laytha ubban Goday hinte Xoossay hintera de7is; hintew aybaaka pacisibeenna.<verse eid="DEU 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 2:8"/>Hessa gisho, “Nuuni nu ishata gidiya Eesawe nayti de7iya Sayre biittara kanthidi bida. Qassi Elaatanne Exiyoon-Gabira katamatape dendidi, Maxine Abbaako gathiya ogiya aggidi, Moo7abe mela biittara aadhida. <verse eid="DEU 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 2:9"/>Goday taako, ‘Taani enta biittafe aybaka hintew immonna gisho, Moo7abe asaara kacetofite woyko enta olopite. Era katamaa taani laata oothada Looxe kochaas koyro immas’ ” yaagis.<verse eid="DEU 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 2:10"/>(He biittan kase minonne daro gidida, qassi Anaaqe kochatada adusse gidida Emimeta geetetiya asati de7idosona. <verse eid="DEU 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 2:11"/>Enti Anaaqetada Raafaymeta geetetoosona. Shin Moo7abe asay enta Emimeta gidi xeegosona. <verse eid="DEU 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 2:12"/>Hoora biitta asay kase Sayren de7idosona, shin Isra7eele asay laattana mela Goday entaw immida biittan enti oothidaysada Eesawa kochati Hoorata enta biittafe shoddidosona. Qassi banta sinthafe enta dhaysidi enta bessan uttidosona.)<verse eid="DEU 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 2:13"/>Goday nuuko, “Ha77i dendite, Zareada Shaafa pinnite” yaagin, nuuni Zareda Shaafa pinnida. <verse eid="DEU 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 2:14"/>Nuuni Qaades-Barnefe dendidi, Zareda Shaafa pinnana gakanaw hastamanne hospun laythi aadhis. He wode Goday entaw caaqidaysada olas gakida adde ubbay wuris. <verse eid="DEU 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 2:15"/>Dunkaanida gutaape enti kumethi dhayana gakanaw, Godaa kushey enta bolla deexis.<verse eid="DEU 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 2:16"/>Olas gakida adde asa ubbay kumethi dhaydaapenne asaa giddofe hayqidi wuridaape guye, <verse eid="DEU 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 2:17"/>Goday taako, <verse eid="DEU 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 2:18"/>“Era ogiyara hachi hinte Moo7abe biitta kantheeta. <verse eid="DEU 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 2:19"/>Hinte Amoone asaa biitta gakiya wode enta bochofite woyko entara ooyetofite. Amoone asata biittafe aybibaaka taani hintew laata oothada immike. Taani he biitta Looxe kochaas laata oothada koyro immas” yaagis.<verse eid="DEU 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 2:20"/>[He biittay kase yan de7iya asay xeegetiya sunthaa Raafaymeta biitta geetetidi xeegetees. Qassi Amooneti enta Zamzumeta gidi xeegosona. <verse eid="DEU 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 2:21"/>Enti Anaaqetada adusse, minonne daro dere, shin Goday enta dhaysin, Amooneti enta biitta laattidi uttidosona. <verse eid="DEU 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 2:22"/>Goday Sayren de7iya Eesawe kochaas oothidaysada, enta bolla oothis. Hessika I he biittan de7iya Hoorata dhaysin, Eesawe kochay enta biitta laattidi hachi gakanaw uttidosona. <verse eid="DEU 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 2:23"/>Gaaza gakanaw de7iya heeran de7iya Aweeti, Kaftoore biittafe yida Kaftooreti enta dhaysidi enta biittan uttidosona.]<verse eid="DEU 2:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 2:24"/>Qassika Goday nuuko, “Dendite; Arnoona Shaafa pinnite. Heko, Amoore biitta asi gidida Haseboona kawa Sihoonanne iya biitta ta hinte kushen aathada immas; iya olidi iya biitta laattite. <verse eid="DEU 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 2:25"/>Hachife doomin salope garsan de7iya asa ubbay hintew yayyana mela taani oothana. Enti hintebaa si7iya wode ubban yashshan kokorana” yaagis.<verse eid="DEU 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Sihoone Xoonetethaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 21:21-30">Taybo 21:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 2:26"/>Hessafe guye, Qidemoota mela biittafe Haseboona kawa Sihoonas kiitanchota bolla haysada yaagada saro qaala kiittas. <verse eid="DEU 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 2:27"/>“Nuna ne biittara aatharki; nuuni wogga ogiya xalaala oykidi baana; iyape ushachi woyko haddirsi gooko. <verse eid="DEU 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 2:28"/>Nuuni miya kathasinne uyaa haathas miishe qanxana. Nu koyey ne biittara kanthi aatha xalaala. <verse eid="DEU 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 2:29"/>Sayren de7iya Eesawe kochatinne, Eran de7iya Moo7abe kochati nuna aathidaysada Goday nu Xoossay, nuus immiya biittas Yordaanose shaafa nuuni pinnana gakanaw yaara nuna aatha” yaagas. <verse eid="DEU 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 2:30"/>Shin Haseboona kawoy Sihooney nuna aathona ixis. Goday hinte Xoossay ha77i oothidaysada iya hinte kushen aathidi immanaw koyida gisho iya wozanaa muumisisdi, otorancho oothis.<verse eid="DEU 2:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 2:31"/>Hessafe guye Goday taako, “Heko, Sihoonanne iya biitta ta new aathada immo doomas; ha77i xoonada iya biitta laatta” yaagis.<verse eid="DEU 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 2:32"/>Sihooney ba olanchota ubbaa ekidi Yahaaxa geetetiya bessan nuura oletanaw keyis. <verse eid="DEU 2:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 2:33"/>Shin Goday nu Xoossay nuus iya aathidi immin, iya, iya adde naytanne iya olanchota ubbaa nuuni wodhida. <verse eid="DEU 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 2:34"/>He wode nuuni iya katamata ubbaa oykidi, iyan de7iya adde, maccanne na7a ubbaa ashshona dhaysida. <verse eid="DEU 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 2:35"/>Enta mehiyanne nuuni oykida katamatape di77idaysa xalaala nuus ekida. <verse eid="DEU 2:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 2:36"/>Arnoona Zangaara gaxan de7iya Aro7eerapenne he zangaara giddon de7iya katamaape bidi Galada biitta gakanaw nuura eqetida issi katamika deenna. Goday nu Xoossay enta ubbaa nu kushen aathidi immis. <verse eid="DEU 2:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 2:37"/>Shin nuuni Amoone biittako, Yaaboqa Shaafa gaxan de7iya biittako, gezze biittan de7iya katamatakonne Goday nu Xoossay nuuni boonna mela diggida bessaa ubbaa shiiqibooko.<verse eid="DEU 2:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="DEU 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Ooge Xoonetethaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 21:31-35">Taybo 21:31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 3:1"/>Hessafe guye, nuuni simmidi Baasane efiya ogiyara keyida. Baasane kawoy Oogey, ba olanchota ubbaara Edraa7a geetetiya bessan nuura oletanaw keyis. <verse eid="DEU 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 3:2"/>Shin Goday taako, “Iyaw yayyofa; taani iya, iya olanchotanne iya biitta ubbaa ne kushen aathada immas. Haseboonan uttidi kawotida Amooreta kawa Sihoona bolla oothidaysada neeni iya bolla oothana” yaagis.<verse eid="DEU 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 3:3"/>Hessa gisho, Goday nu Xoossay Baasane kawa Oogenne iya asa ubbaa nu kushen aathidi immis; nuuni entafe issuwaka ashshona wursidi wodhida. <verse eid="DEU 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 3:4"/>He wode nuuni iya katamata ubbaa oykida; nuuni oykiboonna issi katamika deenna; hessika, Baasane kawa Oogey Argoba biittan aysiya usupun tammu katamata ubbaa oykida. <verse eid="DEU 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 3:5"/>Ha katamati ubbay adussa gimben diretidaysatanne pengeti kobetidaysata. Gimbe dirsi bayna daro gutatika de7oosona. <verse eid="DEU 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 3:6"/>Haseboona kawa Sihoona bolla oothidaysada nuuni enta kumethi dhaysida. Enta katamatan de7iya adde, maccanne na7a ashshona dhaysida. <verse eid="DEU 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 3:7"/>Shin mehe ubbaanne katamatape di77idabaa nuus ekida.<verse eid="DEU 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 3:8"/>He wode nuuni Arnoona zangaarape bidi Armoona zumaa gakanaw de7iya biitta, Yordaanose Shaafape doloha baggara de7iya nam7u Amoore biittata kawotape ekida. <verse eid="DEU 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 3:9"/>(Sidoona biitta asay Armoona zumaa, Siriyoona gidi xeegiya wode, Amoore biitta asay Sanira gidi xeegosona.) <verse eid="DEU 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 3:10"/>Nuuni demba biittan de7iya katamata ubbaa, Galada biitta ubbaa, Baasane biitta ubbaanne Baasane biittan Oogey haariya Salakanne Edraa7a katamata gakanaw de7iya bessaa oykida. <verse eid="DEU 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 3:11"/>(Raafaymetape attiday Baasane kawa Ooge xalaala. Iya arsay birata arsi; he arsay hachi gakanaw Raaba geetetiya Amooneta kataman de7ees; iya adussatethay hospun wadha; gompay oyddu wadha.)<verse eid="DEU 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yordaanosepe Hefinthan Utida Kochata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 32:1-42">Taybo 32:1-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 3:12"/>He biitta nuuni laatidaape guye, Arnoona shaafa doonan de7iya Aro7eera katamaape doomidi de7iya bessaanne derey dariya Galada biittafe baggaa gujada iya katamatara Robeelasinne Gaade kochaas taani immas. <verse eid="DEU 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 3:13"/>Galadape attidaysanne Oogey haariya Baasane biitta ubbaa Minaase kochaa baggaas immas; hessika, Argoba kawotethaa. (He Baasane biittay ubbay Raafaymeta biitta geetetidi xeegetees. <verse eid="DEU 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 3:14"/>Minaase kochaafe Ya7iri kumetha Argoba biitta laattis; hessika Geeshuretanne Ma7ikata biitta gaxaa gakanaw de7iya Baasane biitta. I he katamata ba sunthan xeegetana mela oothis; hessa gisho, enti hachi gakanaw, Ya7ira katamata geetetidi xeegetoosona.)<verse eid="DEU 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 3:15"/>Galada biitta Minaase koche gidida Makiras immas. <verse eid="DEU 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 3:16"/>Robeelanne Gaade kochaas Galadape bidi Arnoona shaafa mata gakanaw de7iya biitta immas. Dugeha baggara Arnoona Shaafape baggay enta zawa; qassi pudeha baggara Amooneta biittas gaxa gidida Yaaboqa shaafay zawa. <verse eid="DEU 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 3:17"/>Wuloha baggara, enta zaway Araban de7iya Yordaanose shaafa gakees; hessika Galila Abbaafe doomidi Pisga zuma xaphon de7iya Maxine Abbaa (Hayqo Abbaa) gakanaasa.<verse eid="DEU 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 3:18"/>He wode taani hintena haysada yaagada kiittas. “Goday hinte Xoossay he biitta hinte laattana mela hintew immis. Hiza hintew de7iya tooranchota ubbaa ola miishe dancisidi, hinte ishata gidida Isra7eele asaape sinthe aathite. <verse eid="DEU 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 3:19"/>Hintew daro mehey de7eysa taani erayis; hessa gisho, hinte macheti, hinte naytinne hinte mehey taani hintew immida katamatan de7ishshona. <verse eid="DEU 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 3:20"/>Goday hintena shempisidaysada hinte ishata shempisana gakanawunne Yordaanose shaafape hefinthan Goday, hinte Xoossay entaw immiya biitta enti ekana gakanaw entaw oletite. Hessafe guye, taani hintew immida biitta simmeta” yaagis.<verse eid="DEU 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 3:21"/>Taani he wode Iyyasu haysada yaagada kiittas. “Goday, hinte Xoossay ha nam7u kawota bolla oothidaba ubbaa neeni ne ayfen be7adasa; hinte oykanaw biya kawotethata ubbaa bolla Goday hessada oothana. <verse eid="DEU 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 3:22"/>Hintew oletey Godaa hinte Xoossaa gidiya gisho, entaw yayyofite” yaagis.<verse eid="DEU 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Musey Kanaane Gelibeenna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 3:23"/>He wode taani haysada yaagada Godaa minthada woossas. <verse eid="DEU 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 3:24"/>“Ubbaa Haariya Godaw, ne gitatethaanne ne mino kushiya tana, ne aylliya bessanaw doomadasa. Ne oothiya wolqaama oosota oothanaw danda7ey salon gidin sa7an hara xoossi de7ii? <verse eid="DEU 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 3:25"/>Godaw, taani bada Yordaanose shaafape hefinthan de7iya derey dariya lo77o biittanne Libaanose deriya be7ana mela tana yeddarki” yaagas.<verse eid="DEU 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 3:26"/>Shin Goday hinte gaason tana hanqetidi si7onnan ixis. Goday taako, “Hiza new gidana; ha odaa nam7antho denthada haasayopa. <verse eid="DEU 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 3:27"/>Hessa aggada denda; Pisga zuma bolla keya; yan eqada he biitta wuloha bagga, pudeha bagga, dugeha bagganne doloha bagga ne ayfiya dhoqu oothada xeella. Neeni ha Yordaanose shaafa polo pinnaka. <verse eid="DEU 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 3:28"/>Shin neeni Iyyasu kiitta; iya zoranne minthetha. I ha asaa kaalethidi pinthananne ha neeni be7iya biitta enta laatisana” yaagis.<verse eid="DEU 3:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 3:29"/>Hessa gisho, nuuni Beet-Pa7oora sinthan de7iya zangaaran gam7ida.<verse eid="DEU 3:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="DEU 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Musey Isra7eele Asaa Zoris</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 4:1"/>Ha77ika Isra7eele asaw, hinte de7on daana melanne Goday, hinte mayzata Xoossay, hintew immiya biitta hinte laattana mela ta hintena tamaarsiya wogaanne higgiya si7itenne oothite. <verse eid="DEU 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 4:2"/>Ta hintena kiittiya, Godaa hinte Xoossaa kiitta naagitepe attishin, iya bolla aykoka gujofite; iyape aykoka pacisopite. <verse eid="DEU 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 4:3"/>Bi7eel-Fagoora zuma bolla Goday oothidaba hinte, hinte ayfen be7ideta. Goday, hinte Xoossay Bi7eel-Fagoora eeqa goyinnidaysata ubbaa hinte giddofe dhaysis. <verse eid="DEU 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 4:4"/>Shin hinte Godaas, hinte Xoossaas ammanetida gisho, hachi gakanaw ubbayka de7on de7eeta.<verse eid="DEU 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 4:5"/>Heko, hinte laattanaw geliya biittan oothana mela Goday, ta Xoossay tana kiitida wogaanne higgiya ta hintena tamaarsas. <verse eid="DEU 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 4:6"/>Hinte enta naagitenne oothite. Hinte hessa oothiko, hinte ay mela cinceko hara asay hintena be7ana. Enti ha wogabaa si7iya wode, “Tumaka ha gita kawotethay cincanne akeekancho kawotethi” yaagana. <verse eid="DEU 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 4:7"/>Nuuni iya xeegiya wode ubban Goday, nu Xoossay nuus mata gideysada xoossi mata gidida hara ay wolqaama kawotethi de7ii? <verse eid="DEU 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 4:8"/>Taani hachi hinte sinthan wothiya ha higge ubbaa mela xillo gidida woginne higgey de7iya hara ay gita kawotethi de7ii?<verse eid="DEU 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 4:9"/>Hiza ne de7o laytha ubban ha ne be7idaba ubbaa dogonna melanne ne wozanan wothana mela naageta. Ne naytanne ne nayta nayta tamaarsa. <verse eid="DEU 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 4:10"/>Koreeba zumaa bolla Godaa, hinte Xoossaa sinthan hinte eqida wode Goday taako, “Ta qaala enti si7idi, banta laytha ubban taw yayyana melanne banta nayta hessa tamaarsana mela asaa taako shiisha” gidaysa akeekite. <verse eid="DEU 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 4:11"/>He wode hinte shiiqidi zumaa xaphon eqideta; salo gakanaw tami eexis. He zumaa xaphoy sakana dhumaninne shaaran goozetis. <verse eid="DEU 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 4:12"/>Goday tama giddon gididi hintew odis. Hinte iya girsa si7idetape attishin, iya malaa be7ibeeketa. <verse eid="DEU 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 4:13"/>Hinte oothana mela I hintena kiitida ba caaquwa hintew odis; hessika Tammu Kiitata. I enta nam7u loche shuchata bolla xaafis. <verse eid="DEU 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 4:14"/>Hinte laattanaw biya biittan oothana mela wogaanne higgiya hintena tamaarsana mela Goday tana he wode kiittis.<verse eid="DEU 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Eeqa goyinnoy Nagara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 4:15"/>Goday Koreeba zumaa bolla tama giddon gididi hintew odida gallas hinte iya malaa be7iboona gisho loythi naagetite. <verse eid="DEU 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 4:16"/>Adde woyko macca medhon oosetidaba gidin, <verse eid="DEU 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 4:17"/>sa7an de7iya do7a ubbaa leemison gidin, salora paalliya kafo ubbaa leemison gidin, <verse eid="DEU 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 4:18"/>sa7a bolla ulora gooshetiya medhetetha leemison gidin, haatha giddon de7iya molo leemison gidin, hinte tunonna mela hintew xoosse oothidi medhofite. <verse eid="DEU 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 4:19"/>Salo pude xeellida, Goday ne Xoossay salope garsan de7iya kawotethatas imida awa, ageena, xoolintotanne salo medhetethata ubbaa be7ida, ne entaw goyinnada balonna mela naageta. <verse eid="DEU 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 4:20"/>Shin Goday hintena hachi hinte hanidaysada baw dummatida ase oothanaw birata seerisiya cooce mela gidida Gibxefe kessidi ehis.<verse eid="DEU 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 4:21"/>Hinte gaason Goday tana hanqetidi, Yordaanose pinnonna melanne Goday hinte Xoossay, laata oothidi hintew immiya lo77o biitta taani gelonna mela caaqis. <verse eid="DEU 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 4:22"/>Hessa gisho, taani Yordaanose shaafa pinnonna ha biittan hayqana, shin hinte pinnidi he lo77o biitta laatteeta. <verse eid="DEU 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 4:23"/>Hiza Goday, hinte Xoossay hintera caaqida caaquwa dogopite. Goday, ne Xoossay nena oothofa gida ay medhon oosetida misile new eeqa oothonna mela naageta. <verse eid="DEU 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 4:24"/>Goday, ne Xoossay miya tamanne qanaatiya Xoossi.<verse eid="DEU 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 4:25"/>Ne naytanne, nayta nayta yelada he biittan adussa wode de7iya wode ay medhon oosetida misile goyinnada tuniko, qassi Godaa, ne Xoossa hanqethanaw iya sinthan iitaba oothiko, <verse eid="DEU 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 4:26"/>hinte Yordaanose shaafa pinnidi laattanaw biya biittafe issoyka attonna elle dhayanaw de7eysas, ta hachi hinte bolla salonne sa7a markayayis. Hinte polo dhayanape attishin, he biittan adussa wode de7eketa. <verse eid="DEU 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 4:27"/>Goday hintena hara asaa giddon laallana; hintena I laaliya kawotethata giddon hinte tayboy guutha gidana. <verse eid="DEU 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 4:28"/>Yan hinte mithafenne shuchafe asa kushen giigida be7onna, si7onna, moonnanne singonna xoossata goyinnana. <verse eid="DEU 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 4:29"/>Shin yan de7ashe ne Godaa, ne Xoossaa koyana; ne iya kumetha wozanapenne kumetha shempofe koyko demmana. <verse eid="DEU 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 4:30"/>He meto ubbaa giddon ne un7etada de7iya wode wursethan Godaako, ne Xoossaako simmananne iya qaalas kiitetana. <verse eid="DEU 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 4:31"/>Goday, ne Xoossay maarotethan kumida Xoosse gidiya gisho, I nena aggenna woyko dhaysena; ne mayzatas caaqida caaquwa dogenna.<verse eid="DEU 4:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 4:32"/>Goday biittan ase medhida gallasape doomidi, hintefe kase aadhida wodiya ane pilgite; hessa mela gitabay polo hani eriyako woyko si7etidi eriyako saluwas ha gaxape ya gaxaa gakanaw ane oychite. <verse eid="DEU 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 4:33"/>Tama laco giddon Goday haasayin si7idi, hinte dhayona de7on de7eysada Goday odishin si7idi, de7on de7ida hara asi de7ii? <verse eid="DEU 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 4:34"/>Woyko Goday, hinte Xoossay hinte xeellishin, Gibxe biittan hintew oothidaysada paacen, malaatan, malaalsiyaban, olan, wolqaama kusheninne micetida qesen, gita yashshan hara kawotetha giddo gelidi, issi kawotethaa baw ekanaw butetida hara xoossi de7ii? <verse eid="DEU 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 4:35"/>Goday, Xoosse gideysa hinte erana mela hessa I hintena bessis; iyape attishin, hara xoossi baawa. <verse eid="DEU 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 4:36"/>I hintena tamaarsanaw koyida gisho, ba girsaa salope sissis. Qassi ha sa7an ba gita tama hintena bessis; he tama giddofe hinte iya qaala si7ideta. <verse eid="DEU 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 4:37"/>I hessa oothiday hinte aawata siiqidi, entafe guye yeletiya enta sheeshata doorida gisho, hintena Gibxefe ba gita wolqan kessis. <verse eid="DEU 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 4:38"/>Hachi hinte be7eysada, hintena gelsanawunne enta biitta hintew laata oothidi immanaw, hintefe dariyanne wolqaamiya kawotethata hinte sinthafe yedethidi kessis. <verse eid="DEU 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 4:39"/>Hiza, bolla salon gidin, garsa sa7an gidin, Goday Xoosse gideysa erite; hinte wozanan wothite; hara xoossi baawa. <verse eid="DEU 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 4:40"/>Hessa gisho, hintewunne hintefe guye hinte naytas ubbabay lo77o gidana mela, qassi Goday hinte Xoossay hintew merinaw immiya biittan hinte laythay aduqana mela, taani hachi hintena kiittiya wogaanne higgiya naagite.<verse eid="DEU 4:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Baqatidi Attiya Katamata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 4:41"/>Hessafe guye, Musey Yordaanose hefinthan doloha baggara heedzu katamata dummayis. <verse eid="DEU 4:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 4:42"/>Hessa I dummayiday kase morketethi bayna de7ishin, eronna de7ishe ase wodhida asi yaa baqatana melasa. He uray he katamatape issuwau baqatidi ba shempuwa ashshanaw danda7ees. <verse eid="DEU 4:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 4:43"/>Hessa gisho, Robeela kochaas gadhan dere bolla de7iya Boosora katamaa, Gaade kochaas Galadan de7iya Ramootanne Minaase kochaas Baasanen de7iya Goolana katamata dummayis.<verse eid="DEU 4:43"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Imetida Higgiya Birshethaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 4:44"/>Musey Isra7eele asaas immida Godaa higgey haysa; <verse eid="DEU 4:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 4:45"/>Musey ha wogaa, awaajuwanne higgiya enti Gibxefe keyida wode immis. <verse eid="DEU 4:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 4:46"/>Hessi entaw imetiday enti Beet-Pa7oora katamaa sinthan de7iya Yordaanosepe doloha baggara de7iya zangaaran de7ishina. He bessay Museynne Isra7eele asay Gibxefe keyida wode olidi xoonida, Haseboonan uttidi Amoore haariya kawa Sihoona biitta. <verse eid="DEU 4:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 4:47"/>He wode enti iya biittanne Baasane kawa Ooge biitta, hessika Yordaanosepe doloha baggan de7iya nam7u Amoore kawota laattidosona. <verse eid="DEU 4:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 4:48"/>He biittay Arnoona zangaaran Aro7eera katamaape bidi, Siriyoona deriya gakees; Siriyoona geetetidi xeegetiya derey Armoona zuma. <verse eid="DEU 4:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 4:49"/>He biittay Yordaanosepe doloha baggara de7iya Araba biitta ubbaa ekidi bidi, Pisga deriya xaphon de7iya Maxine Abbaa gakees.<verse eid="DEU 4:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="DEU 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Tammu Kiitata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 20:1-17">Kessa 20:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 5:1"/>Musey Isra7eele asaa ubbaa issife xeegidi, haysada yaagis; “Hinteno, Isra7eele asaw taani hachi hintew odiya wogaanne higgiya si7ite; enta tamaarite; minthidi naagite. <verse eid="DEU 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 5:2"/>Goday, nu Xoossay Koreeba zumaa bolla nuura caaqis. <verse eid="DEU 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 5:3"/>Goday he caaquwa caaqiday nu aawata xalaalara gidonashin, hachi de7on de7iya nu ubbaara caaqis. <verse eid="DEU 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 5:4"/>He zumaa bolla eexiya tama giddon gididi, Goday som7on hintera haasayis. <verse eid="DEU 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 5:5"/>Taani he wode Goday giyaba hintew odanaw, Godaapenne hintefe giddon eqas. Hinte tamas yayyidi zumaa bolla keyibeketa. Goday haysada yaagis.<verse eid="DEU 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 5:6"/>“Gibxe biittafe, aylletetha keethaafe nena woziday taani Godaa, ne Xoossaa.<verse eid="DEU 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 5:7"/>“Taape attishin, hara xoossati new de7opo.<verse eid="DEU 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 5:8"/>“Bolla salon de7iyaba gidin, garsa sa7an de7iyaba gidin, woyko haatha giddon de7iyaba gidin, ay misile new eeqa oothofa. <verse eid="DEU 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 5:9"/>Ne iyaw hokofa woyko iyaw goyinnofa. Taani tana ixeyisata aawata nagaraa gisho, nayta heedzanthonne oyddantho yeletaa gakanaw seerayis. Taani, Goday, ne Xoossay qanaatiya Xoossaa. <verse eid="DEU 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 5:10"/>Shin taani tana siiqeysatanne ta kiita naageysata mukulu yeletaa gakanaw ta merinaa siiquwa bessayis.<verse eid="DEU 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 5:11"/>“Godaa, ne Xoossaa sunthaa coo xeegopa. Goday ba sunthaa coo xeegiya uraa seeronna aggenna.<verse eid="DEU 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 5:12"/>“Goday, ne Xoossay nena kiittidaysada Sambaata gallasaa geeshshi oothada naaga. <verse eid="DEU 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 5:13"/>Neeni ne ooso ubbaa usupun gallasan ootha. <verse eid="DEU 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 5:14"/>Shin laapuntha gallasay Godaas, ne Xoossaas Sambaata. He gallas ay oosoka oothofa. Neeni woyko ne adde na7ay woyko ne macca na7iya woyko ne oosanchoy woyko ne oosanchiya woyko ne booray woyko ne harey woyko ne hara meheti woyko ne kataman de7iya bete asi he gallas ay oosoka oothopite. Neeni shempeysada ne adde aylleytinne macca aylleti shempo. <verse eid="DEU 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 5:15"/>Neeni Gibxe biittan aylle gidada de7idaysa dogopa. Goday, ne Xoossay ba wolqaama kushiyaninne ba micetida qesiyan yaape nena kessidaysa dogopa. Goday, ne Xoossay Sambaata gallas neeni naagana mela kiitiday hessa gishosa.<verse eid="DEU 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 5:16"/>“Goday, ne Xoossay new immiya biittan ne laythay aduqana malanne new lo77ana mela Goday, ne Xoossay nena kiittidaysada ne aawanne ne aayiw boncha.<verse eid="DEU 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 5:17"/>“Wodhopa.<verse eid="DEU 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 5:18"/>“Laammofa.<verse eid="DEU 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 5:19"/>“Kaysotopa.<verse eid="DEU 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 5:20"/>“Wordo markatofa.<verse eid="DEU 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 5:21"/>“Hara asa macho amottofa; iya keethaa, iya shooqa, iya adde aylliya woyko iya macca aylliw woyko iya boora woyko iya hariya woyko iyaw de7iyaba aybaka amottofa” yaagis.<verse eid="DEU 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 5:22"/>Zumaa bolla tama, shaaranne dhumaa giddofe Goday dhoqu gida girsan duulata ubbaas odida qaalati haysata. I enta bolla aybaka gujibeenna; enta nam7u loche shuchata bolla xaafidi taw immis.<verse eid="DEU 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 5:23"/>Zumay taman xuugetishin, dhumaa giddofe girsaa hinte si7ida wode hinte kochaa halaqatinne cimati taako yidi, <verse eid="DEU 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 5:24"/>haysada yaagidosona; “Nuuni Godaa, nu Xoossaa girsaa tamaa giddofe si7ida wode Goday, nu Xoossay ba bonchuwanne ba gitatetha nuna bessis. Xoossi asara haasayin si7idi asi de7on daanaw danda7eysa hachi nuuni be7ida. <verse eid="DEU 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 5:25"/>Shin ha wolqaama tamay nuna dhaysanaw danda7ees; yaatin, nuuni ayis hayqanee? Godaa, nu Xoossaa qaala nuuni nam7antho si7iko hayqana. <verse eid="DEU 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 5:26"/>Asho ma7ida asan nuuni si7idaysada tama giddon gididi odishin, de7o Xoossaa qaala si7idi de7on de7ida asi oonee? <verse eid="DEU 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 5:27"/>Hessa gisho, neeni shiiqada Goday, nu Xoossay giyaba ubbaa si7a; Goday, nu Xoossay new odiyaba nuus oda; nuka si7idi kiitetana” yaagideta.<verse eid="DEU 5:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 5:28"/>Hinte taw odishin Goday, hinte giyaba si7idi, taako haysada yaagis; “Ha asay new odiyaba ubbaa si7as; enti gidaba ubbay like. <verse eid="DEU 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 5:29"/>Entawunne enta naytas merinaw ubbabay injetana mela taw yayyanawunne ta kiita naaganaw entaw ubba wode hessa mela wozani de7eerenne. <verse eid="DEU 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 5:30"/>Ha77i neeni bada enti banta dunkaaniya simmana mela oda. <verse eid="DEU 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 5:31"/>Shin neeni haysan ta matan gam7a. Enti laattana mela taani entaw immiya biittan enti oothanaba neeni enta tamaarsana ta kiita, ta awaajuwanne ta higgiya ubbaa ta new odana” yaagis.<verse eid="DEU 5:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 5:32"/>Hinteno, Isra7eele asaw, Goday, hinte Xoossay hintena kiittidaba ubbaa oothanaw naagetite; iyape ushachi woyko haddirsi goopite. <verse eid="DEU 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 5:33"/>Hinte de7on daana mela, ubbay hintew injetana melanne hinte laattiya biittan hinte laythay aduqana mela, Goday hinte Xoossay hintena kiitida kiita naagite.<verse eid="DEU 5:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="DEU 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Gita Kiita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 6:1"/>Hinte laattanaw biya biittan hinte oothana mela ta hintena tamaarsana mela Goday, hinte Xoossay tana kiitida kiitay, awaajoynne higgey haysa. <verse eid="DEU 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 6:2"/>Ne laythay aduqana mela ne, ne naytinne ne nayta nayite Godaa ne Xoossaa yayya; ta hachi new immiya Godaa awaajiyanne higgiya ne laytha ubban naaga. <verse eid="DEU 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 6:3"/>Neno, Isra7eele si7a; ubbabay new injetana melanne Goday ne aawata Xoossay, new gidaysada maathinne eessi goggiya biittan ne darana mela ha higgeta si7a; minthada naaga.<verse eid="DEU 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 6:4"/>Neno, Isra7eele si7a; Goday nu Xoossay issi Xoossi. <verse eid="DEU 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 6:5"/>Ne Godaa, ne Xoossaa ne kumetha wozanaape, ne kumetha shempuwafenne ne kumetha wolqaafe dosa. <verse eid="DEU 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 6:6"/>Hachi ta nena kiittiya ha kiitaa ne wozanan wotha. <verse eid="DEU 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 6:7"/>Enta neeni ne nayta tamaarsa; neeni ne son uttiya wode, oge hemetiya wode, zin7iya wodenne dendiya wode entaba haasaya. <verse eid="DEU 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 6:8"/>Malla oothada ne kushen enta qacha; qassi ne som7on mallada wotha. <verse eid="DEU 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 6:9"/>Ne penge zizgeta bollanne ne dirsa pengiya bolla enta xaafa.<verse eid="DEU 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 6:10"/>Goday, ne Xoossay new immana gidi ne aawatas Abrahaames, Yisaaqasinne Yayqoobas caaqida, ne keexaboonna gitanne lo77o katamati kumida biitta new immana. <verse eid="DEU 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 6:11"/>Neeni shiishaboona duretethan kumida keethata, ne bookaboona haatha ollata, ne tokaboonna woynenne shamaho new immiya wode, neeni mada kallida wode, <verse eid="DEU 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 6:12"/>nena Gibxe aylletetha biittafe kessida, Godaa dogonna mela naageta. <verse eid="DEU 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 6:13"/>Godaa, ne Xoossaa yayya; iya xalaala goyinna; iya sunthan caaqa. <verse eid="DEU 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 6:14"/>Ne yuushon de7iya asay goyinniya hara xoossata goyinnofa. <verse eid="DEU 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 6:15"/>Ne giddon de7iya Goday, ne Xoossay qanaatiya Xoossu. Iya hanqoy ne bolla eexana; I nena biitta bollafe pitidi dhaysana. <verse eid="DEU 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 6:16"/>Masahan hinte iya paacidaysada Godaa hinte Xoossaa paacopite. <verse eid="DEU 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 6:17"/>Goday, hinte Xoossay hintena kiitida iya kiita, iya wogaanne iya awaajuwa minthidi naagite. <verse eid="DEU 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 6:18"/>New ubbabay injetana mela Godaa sinthan ne surebaanne lo77oba ootha. Hessa oothiko, new immanaw Goday ne aawatas caaqida, he lo77o biitta ne laattana. <verse eid="DEU 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 6:19"/>Goday gidaysada neeni, ne morketa ubbaa ne sinthafe gooddana.<verse eid="DEU 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 6:20"/>Wodepe ne nayti, “Goday, nu Xoossay hintena kiitida ha wogaa, awaajiyanne higgiya birshethay aybee?” yaagidi hintena oychiya wode, <verse eid="DEU 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 6:21"/>ne entaw haysada yaagada zaarana; “Nuuni Gibxe biittan Gibxe kawa aylleta, shin Goday ba mino kushiyan nuna Gibxefe kessis. <verse eid="DEU 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 6:22"/>Goday nu xeellishin, Gibxe biitta bolla, Gibxe kawa bollanne iya shuumata ubbaa bolla gitanne yashshiya malaatatanne malaalsiyabata oothis. <verse eid="DEU 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 6:23"/>Shin I nu mayzas immana gidi caaqida biitta nuus immanaw nuna Gibxefe kessis. <verse eid="DEU 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 6:24"/>Yaatidi hachi hinte be7eysada nuus ubba wode lo77o gidana melanne nuuni de7on daana mela, Goday, ha awaajota ubbaa nuni naagana melanne Godaas nu Xoossaas yayyana mela kiittis. <verse eid="DEU 6:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 6:25"/>I nuna kiittidaysada, Godaa, nu Xoossaa sinthan ha kiita ubbaa minthidi naagiko, hessi nuus xillotethi gidana” yaagite.<verse eid="DEU 6:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="DEU 7"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 7:1"/>Goday, ne Xoossay ne laattanaw biya biitta nena gelsiya wodenne neepe wolqaamanne minniya laapun kawotethata, hessatika Hiteta, Gergeseta, Amooreta, Kanaaneta, Parzeta, Hiwetanne Yaabuseta ne sinthafe gooddiya wode, <verse eid="DEU 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 7:2"/>Goday ne Xoossay ne kushen aathidi immin, ne enta xooniya wode, enta kumethi dhaysa. Entara aybibaaka caaqofa; entaw qadhetofa. <verse eid="DEU 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 7:3"/>Entara eketofa; geletofa. Ne macca nayta enta adde naytas immofa woyko enta macca nayta ne adde naytas ekofa. <verse eid="DEU 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 7:4"/>Enti ne nayta tana kaalleysa aggidi hara eeqata goyinnana mela oothana. He wode Godaa hanqoy ne bolla eexana; nena ellesidi dhaysana. <verse eid="DEU 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 7:5"/>Hessa gisho, enta yarsho bessa laallite; goyinno shucha eeqata mentherethite. Asheera geetetiya eeqa misiliya tincherethite; kushen oosetida misileta taman xuuggite. <verse eid="DEU 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 7:6"/>Neeni, ne Godaa Xoossaas geeshsha dere. Goday, ne Xoossay nena baw dumma asi oothidi biitta bolla de7iya asa ubbaafe nena dooris.<verse eid="DEU 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 7:7"/>Goday hintena dosidaynne dooriday hinte hara asaape taybon darida gisho gidenna. Hinte hara asa ubbaafe taybon guutha. <verse eid="DEU 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 7:8"/>Shin Goday hintena dosida gishonne hinte mayzatas caaqida caaquwa naagida gisho, I hintena aylletetha biittafe, Gibxe kawa kushepe, ba wolqaama kushiyan kessisinne wozis. <verse eid="DEU 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 7:9"/>Hessa gisho, Goday, hinte Xoossay Xoosse gideysa erite. I bana doseysatasinne ba kiita naageysatas mukulu yeletethi gakanaw, ba siiquwa naagiya ammanetiya Xoossi. <verse eid="DEU 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 7:10"/>Shin I bana ixeyisata seeranawunne dhaysanaw guye geenna. <verse eid="DEU 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 7:11"/>Hessa gisho, taani hachi new immiya kiita, awaajuwanne higgiya naaga.<verse eid="DEU 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 7:12"/>Ne ha kiita sa7ada mintha naagiko, Goday, ne Xoossay hinte mayzatas caaqidaysada ba siiqo caaquwa new naagana. <verse eid="DEU 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 7:13"/>I nena dosana; nena anjana; ne taybuwa darsana. Qassi I new immanaw ne mayzatas caaqida biittan ne ulo ayfiya, biitta ayfiya; kathaa, woyniya, zaytiya, mehe maratanne dorsa marata darsidi nena anjana. <verse eid="DEU 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 7:14"/>Ne hara asaape aadhada anjetidaysa gidana. Addey woyko macci woyko ne mehey maynnena. <verse eid="DEU 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 7:15"/>Goday harge ubbaafe nena naagana. Neeni Gibxe biittan eriya iita hargiya ne bolla ehenna, shin I nena ixiya ubbaa bolla he hargiya ehana. <verse eid="DEU 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 7:16"/>Goday, ne Xoossay new aathidi immiya asa ubbaa qadhetonna dhaysa. Hessi new xihe gidana gisho, enta xoossata goyinnofa.<verse eid="DEU 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 7:17"/>Neeni, ne wozanan, “Ha kawotethati taape minnoosona; yaatin, ta enta waatada gooddada kessanee?” gaanaw danda7aasa. <verse eid="DEU 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 7:18"/>Shin entaw yayyofa. Goday, ne Xoossay, Gibxe kawa bollanne Gibxe biitta ubbaa bolla oothidaysa akeeka. <verse eid="DEU 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 7:19"/>Goday, ne Xoossay nena Gibxefe kessiya wode oothida gita gadota, malaatata, malaalsiyabata, iya wolqaama kushiyanne iya micetida qesiya ne, ne ayfen be7adasa. Hachi ne yayiya asa ubbaa bolla Goday, ne Xoossay hessada oothana. <verse eid="DEU 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 7:20"/>Qassi neepe baqatidi qosetidaysati dhayana gakanaw Goday, ne Xoossay enta giddon kazhe yeddana. <verse eid="DEU 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 7:21"/>Hessa gisho, ne entaw yayyofa; neera de7iya Goday, ne Xoossay, gitanne yashshiya Xoossi. <verse eid="DEU 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 7:22"/>Goday, ne Xoossay he kawotethata guuthara guuthara gooddidi, ne sinthafe dhaysana. Ne enta ubbaa issi toho dhaysaka; hessa ne oothiko, biittan de7iya do7ati daridi nena waaysana. <verse eid="DEU 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 7:23"/>Shin Goday, ne Xoossay enta ne kushen aathidi immana; enti dhayana gakanaw I enta daganthana. <verse eid="DEU 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 7:24"/>Enta kawota ne kushen aathidi immana. Ne enta suntha salope garsan quchada dhaysana. Oonika neera eqetidi danda7enna; ne enta dhaysana.<verse eid="DEU 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 7:25"/>Kushen oosetida enta eeqa misileta taman xuugga. He misileta bolla de7iya bira woyko worqaa amottofite; nebaa oothada ekofa. Hessi Godaas, ne Xoossaas tuna gidiya gisho, iyape ne ekiko new xihe gidana. <verse eid="DEU 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 7:26"/>Enti banta huuphen baadetidaysata gidiya gisho, ne he tuna eeqata ne soo gelsada, enta mela baadetidaysata gidopa. Enta kumethi ixa; shaateta.<verse eid="DEU 7:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="DEU 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Godaa Dogopite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 8:1"/>Hinte de7on daana mela, hinte tayboy darana melanne Goday kase hinte mayzatas immana gidi caaqida biitta gelidi, hinte laattana mela hachi ta hintena kiittiya kiita ubbaa minthidi naagite. <verse eid="DEU 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 8:2"/>Goday, ne Xoossay new immida kiita ne naagiyakonne naagonnaako, ne wozanaa qofaa eranaw nena paacanawunne nena aada oothanaw oytamu laythi kumethi nena mela biittan waati kaalethidaako akeeka. <verse eid="DEU 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 8:3"/>Aadatethi erisanaw nena koshaysis; yaatidi ne woyko ne mayzati eronna Manna nena muzis. Hessa I oothiday asi Godaa doonape keyiya qaala ubbaanape attishin, katha xalaalan de7onnaysa nena tamaarsanaasa. <verse eid="DEU 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 8:4"/>Ha oytamu laythata giddon ne ma7ida ma7oy wuribeenna; ne tohoy kixibeenna. <verse eid="DEU 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 8:5"/>Asi ba na7a seereysada Goday, ne Xoossay nena seeroysa akeeka.<verse eid="DEU 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 8:6"/>Iyaw yayyashenne iya bonchashe Godaa ne Xoossaa kiitaa naaga. <verse eid="DEU 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 8:7"/>Goday ne Xoossay nena zangaarapenne deriyape goggiya shaafatinne pultoti de7iya lo77o biitta gelsanaw ehis. <verse eid="DEU 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 8:8"/>He biittay gisteynne bangi, woyneynne balasey, oromaaney, shamaho zayteynne eessi kumida biitta. <verse eid="DEU 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 8:9"/>He biittay aykoyka paconna hinte kallidi miya biitta. He biittay birati shuchada gela gidida biitta. Zumaape madabe birata bookidi ekiya biitta. <verse eid="DEU 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 8:10"/>Ne mada kallida wode new I immida lo77o biitta gisho, Godaa ne Xoossaa galata. <verse eid="DEU 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 8:11"/>Ta hachi nena kiittiya iya kiita, iya higgiyanne iya awaajuwa naagonna ixada, Godaa ne Xoossaa dogonna mela naageta. <verse eid="DEU 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 8:12"/>Ne mada kalliya wode, lo77o keethi keexada iyan de7iya wode, <verse eid="DEU 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 8:13"/>ne meheynne dorsay dariya wode, new birinne worqi dagaayetiya wode, new de7idabay ubbay dariya wode, <verse eid="DEU 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 8:14"/>he wode, ne wozanay otortonna mela, Gibxe aylletetha keethaafe nena wozida Godaa, ne Xoossaa dogonna mela naageta. <verse eid="DEU 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 8:15"/>I nena iita shooshaynne korney kumida, haathi bayna, gitanne yashshiya mela biittara nena kaalethidaysa dogopa. I new mela biittan zaallafe haathe dhuusis. <verse eid="DEU 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 8:16"/>Ne mayzati eronna mannaa I nena mela biittan muzis. Wursethan new ubbabay injetana mela nena aada oothanawunne paacanaw hessa oothis. <verse eid="DEU 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 8:17"/>Neeni, “Ta wolqaynne ta kushe minotethay ha duretetha taw ehis” goonna mela naageta. <verse eid="DEU 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 8:18"/>Shin ne duretana mela new wolqa immiday Godaa, ne Xoossaa gideysa akeeka. I hessa oothiday, hachi ne be7eysada, ne mayzatara caaqida caaquwa minthanaasa.<verse eid="DEU 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 8:19"/>Shin hinte Godaa hinte Xoossaa aggidi, hara xoossata kaalliko, entaw hokikonne goyinniko, hinte tuma dhayanaysa ta hachi markatayis. <verse eid="DEU 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 8:20"/>Goday, hinte Xoossay hara kawotethata hinte sinthafe dhaysidaysada hinte iyaw kiitetonna ixiko hintenaka dhaysana.<verse eid="DEU 8:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="DEU 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Kiitetetha Ixo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 9:1"/>Neno, Isra7eele si7a; neepe gitatiyanne wolqaamiya kawotethata, gimbey salo gakida gita katamata laattanaw hachi Yordaanose pinnaasa. <verse eid="DEU 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 9:2"/>He biittan de7iya asay minonne adusse. Neeni, “Oonika entara eqetanaw danda7onna Anaaqe kochata” gishin si7adasa. <verse eid="DEU 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 9:3"/>Shin miya tamada neepe sinthara bey Godaa, ne Xoossaa gideysa hachi era. I enta dhaysananne ne sinthan enta kawushana. Goday new gidaysada ne enta gooddada kessananne ellesada dhaysana.<verse eid="DEU 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 9:4"/>Goday, ne Xoossay enta ne sinthafe gooddidaape guye, ne wozanan, “Taani xillo gidiya gisho, ha biitta ta laattana mela Goday tana ehis” goopa. Goday enta ne sinthafe yedethidi kessiday enti iita gidiya gishosa. <verse eid="DEU 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 9:5"/>Ne enta biitta laattanaw yiday ne xillonne suure gidiya gisho gidenna. Shin Goday, ne Xoossay enta ne sinthafe gooddiday ha kawotethati iita gidiya gishonne beni ne mayzatas Abrahaames, Yisaaqasinne Yayqoobas caaqida caaquwa naaganaassa. <verse eid="DEU 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 9:6"/>Hiza ne hessa akeeka. Goday, ne Xoossay ha lo77o biitta nena laatisey ne xillotethaa gishosa gidenna; neeni wozani muumida asi.<verse eid="DEU 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Worqa Mari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 9:7"/>Godaa, hinte Xoossaa mela biittan waatidi yiloyidaako dogopite. Hinte Gibxe biittafe keyida gallasape doomidi, hachi ha bessaa gakanaw Godaa bolla makallideta. <verse eid="DEU 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 9:8"/>Koreeba zumaa bolla Goday hintena dhaysanaw dendana gakanaw hinte Godaa yiloyideta. <verse eid="DEU 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 9:9"/>Goday hintera caaqida caaqoy xaafetida loche shuchata ekanaw taani zumaa bolla keyida wode, yan kathi moonnanne haathe uyonna oytamu gallasinne oytamu qamma gam7as. <verse eid="DEU 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 9:10"/>Hessafe guye, Xoossa biradhen xaafetida nam7u loche shuchata Goday taw immis. Hinte zumaa xaphon shiiqida wode tama giddon Goday hintew immida kiitati he loche shucha bolla xaafetidi uttidosona. <verse eid="DEU 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 9:11"/>Oytamu gallasapenne qammafe guye, Goday ba caaqo qaalay xaafetida nam7u loche shuchata taw immis. <verse eid="DEU 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 9:12"/>Hessafe guye, Goday taako, “Ellesada haysafe duge wodha; neeni Gibxefe kessida ne asay tunis; enti ta kiitaa eeson aggidi, kushen oosetida eeqa goyinnanaw simmidosona” yaagis.<verse eid="DEU 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 9:13"/>Qassika Goday taako, “Taani ha asaa be7as; enti tuma wozana muume asi. <verse eid="DEU 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 9:14"/>Hiza ta enta dhaysona melanne enta sunthaa biitta bollafe quchonna mela tana diggofa. Ta nena entafe minonne dariya kawotethi kessana” yaagis.<verse eid="DEU 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 9:15"/>Taani caaqo qaalay xaafetida nam7u loche shuchata ta kushen oykada zumaa bollafe wodhas; he wode tama lacoy zumaa bolla bentees. <verse eid="DEU 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 9:16"/>He wode Godaa, hinte Xoossaa bolla hinte nagara oothidaysa be7as. Hinte mara misilen oosetida worqa eeqa giigisideta. Goday, hintena kiitida ogiyape eeson hara soo simmideta. <verse eid="DEU 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 9:17"/>Taani ta kushen oykida nam7u loche shuchata holada hinte be7ishin menthas. <verse eid="DEU 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 9:18"/>Hessafe guye, Godaa yiloyanaw hinte iya sinthan iita ooso oothidi, nagara oothida gisho, kaseysada oytamu gallasinne oytamu qamma Godaa sinthan gufannada gam7as; he wode ta kathi mabike; haathe uyabike. <verse eid="DEU 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 9:19"/>Goday hinte bolla yilotidi dhaysanaw dendida gisho taani yayyas. Shin Goday zaaridi tana si7is. <verse eid="DEU 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 9:20"/>Qassi Goday yilotidi Aaronaka dhaysanaw koyis; shin taani he wode Aaronas woossas. <verse eid="DEU 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 9:21"/>Taani hinte nagaran kumida he mara misiliya ekada, taman xuuggas. Iya tincheretha gaaccada dhiille kessas; he dhiilliya zumaape goggiya haathara yeddas.<verse eid="DEU 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 9:22"/>Qassi hinte Taaberan, Masahaninne Qibiroot-Hatawan Godaa yiloyideta. <verse eid="DEU 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 9:23"/>Goday hinteko, “Bidi, taani hintew immida biitta laattite” yaagidi, Qaades-Barnefe yeddida wodeka hinte Godaa, hinte Xoossaa kiita ixidi makallideta. Iyaw ammanetibeketa woyko iya qaalas kiitetibeketa. <verse eid="DEU 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 9:24"/>Taani hintena erida wodiyape doomidi, hinte Godaas makallideta.<verse eid="DEU 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 9:25"/>Goday hintena dhaysana gida gisho, taani oytamu gallasinne oytamu qamma Godaa sinthan gufannada gam7as. <verse eid="DEU 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 9:26"/>Taani Godaa Xoossaako haysada yaagada woossas; “Abeeti Ubbaa Haariya Godaw, neeni ne gita wolqan wozidanne ne mino kushen Gibxefe kessida, ne laata gidida ne asaa dhaysofa. <verse eid="DEU 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 9:27"/>Ne aylleta, Abrahaame, Yisaaqanne Yayqooba qopa; enta wozanaa minotethaa, enta iitatethaanne enta nagaraa taybopa. <verse eid="DEU 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 9:28"/>Hessi hanonna attiko, neeni nuna yaape kessida Gibxe asay, ‘Goday entaw immana gida biitta gelsanaw danda7iboona gishonne enta ixida gisho, mela biittan wodhanaw enta kessis’ yaagana. <verse eid="DEU 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 9:29"/>Gidoshin, ha asay neeni ne gita wolqaaninne ne micetida qesen Gibxefe kessida ne laata gidida ne asaa” yaagas.<verse eid="DEU 9:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="DEU 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Nam7antho Tammu Kiitata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 34:1-10">Kessa 34:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 10:1"/>He wode Goday taako, “Koyroysa mela nam7u loche shuchata giigisada taako zumaa bolla keya. Qassi iya wothanaw mithafe taabote ootha. <verse eid="DEU 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 10:2"/>Taani kase ne menthida shuchata bolla de7iya qaalata ha shuchata bolla xaafana; ne enta taabotiya giddon wotha” yaagis.<verse eid="DEU 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 10:3"/>Taani soqala mithafe taabote oothas. Kaseysa mela nam7u loche shuchata giigisas; he shuchata ta kushen oykada zumaa bolla keyas. <verse eid="DEU 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 10:4"/>Hinte zumaa xaphon shiiqida gallas, tama giddofe Goday hintew odida qaalata, hessika Tammu Kiitata, kase xaafidaysata he shuchata bolla Goday xaafidi enta taw immis. <verse eid="DEU 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 10:5"/>Hessafe guye, taani zumaa bollafe wodhada, Goday tana kiittidaysada, he shuchata ta oothida Taabotiya giddon wothas; ha77ika enti yan de7oosona.<verse eid="DEU 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 10:6"/>Isra7eele asay Ba7aarota Benyaqanape dendidi, Musera bidosona. Aaroni yan hayqidi moogetis; iya na7ay Alaazari iya laattidi, iya bessan kahine halaqa gidis. <verse eid="DEU 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 10:7"/>Enti yaape Gudgoda geetetiya bessa bidosona; yaape qassi goggiya haathati de7iya Yoxibaata geetetiya bessa bidosona. <verse eid="DEU 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 10:8"/>He wode Godaa caaqo Taabotiya tookana mela, Godaa sinthan eqidi iya haggaazana melanne hachi gakanaw enti ootheysa mela Godaa sunthan anjana mela Leewe kochaa Goday baw dummayis. <verse eid="DEU 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 10:9"/>Hessa gisho, Leewe kochaas enta ishata giddon gishoy woyko laati baawa; Goday, hinte Xoossay entaw gidaysada enta laatay Godaa.<verse eid="DEU 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 10:10"/>Taani kaseysada oytamu gallasinne oytamu qamma zumaa bolla gam7as. Goday zaaridi ta woosa si7idi hintena dhaysanaw koybeenna. <verse eid="DEU 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 10:11"/>Goday taako, “Taani enta aawatas immana gada caaqida biitta enti gelana melanne laattana mela ha asaa kaaletha” yaagis.<verse eid="DEU 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossas Kiitetethi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 10:12"/>Neno, Isra7eele, Goday neepe koyey haysa; Godaa, ne Xoossaa yayya; iya ogiya ubban ba; iya dosa; ne kumetha wozanapenne ne kumetha shempuwafe Godaa ne Xoossaas ootha. <verse eid="DEU 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 10:13"/>New injetana mela taani hachi new immiya Godaa kiitatanne awaajota naaga.<verse eid="DEU 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 10:14"/>Saloynne salope bollara de7iya saloti, qassi sa7inne sa7an de7iya ubbay Godaa, ne Xoossaaba gideysi tuma. <verse eid="DEU 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 10:15"/>Gidoshin, Goday hinte mayzatan ufaytidi, enta siiqis; hachi hinte be7eysada entafe guyen enta sheeshi gidida hintena kawotethata ubbaafe aathidi dooris. <verse eid="DEU 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 10:16"/>Hessa gisho, hinte wozanaa qaxarite; hizape hinte wozanaa minthofite. <verse eid="DEU 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 10:17"/>Goday, hinte Xoossay xoossata Xoossinne godata Godaa. I gita Xoossi; I wolqaamanne yashshiya Xoossi. I som7o be7idi pirdenna; wodhaafe ekenna. <verse eid="DEU 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 10:18"/>I yi7otasinne am7etas suure pirdees; betanchuwa siiqidi, iyaw kathinne ma7o immees. <verse eid="DEU 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 10:19"/>Hinteka betanchota siiqite; hinte hinte huuphen bete asi gididi Gibxen de7ideta. <verse eid="DEU 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 10:20"/>Godaa, ne Xoossaa yayya; iyaw ootha; iyara oyketa; iya sunthan caaqa. <verse eid="DEU 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 10:21"/>Neeni ne ayfen be7ida gitanne yashshiya malaalsiyabata new oothiday, I ne galataa; ne Xoossaa. <verse eid="DEU 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 10:22"/>Gibxe biitta wodhida hinte mayzati kumethi laapun tamma; ha77i Goday, hinte Xoossay hintena salo xoolintotada darsis.<verse eid="DEU 10:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="DEU 11"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 11:1"/>Hiza Godaa, ne Xoossaa dosa; iya awaajuwa, wogaa, iya higgiyanne iya kiita ubba wode naaga. <verse eid="DEU 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 11:2"/>Hinte nayti be7onnabaanne eronnabaa gidikoka, hinte hachi Godaa seera, iya gitatetha, iya wolqaama kushiyanne micetida qesiya be7idaysa akeekite. <verse eid="DEU 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 11:3"/>Hinte I oothida malaatatanne Gibxe kawa bollanne iya biitta ubbaa bolla oothida malaalsiyabata be7ideta. <verse eid="DEU 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 11:4"/>Enti hintena kaallidi gooddida wode, Goday Gibxe biitta olanchota, enta paratanne para gaareta Zo7o Abban mitisidi, hachi gakanaw enta kumethi dhaysidaysa be7ideta. <verse eid="DEU 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 11:5"/>Hinte ha bessaa gakanaw mela biittan Goday hintew oothidaba hinte ereeta. <verse eid="DEU 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 11:6"/>Robeela kochaafe Eli7aaba nayta gidida Daatane bollanne Abeero bolla Goday oothidaysa akeekite. Isra7eele asa ubbay be7ishin, biittay dooyetidi, enta, enta soo asaa, enta dunkaaniyanne shempora de7iya entaba ubbaa mittis. <verse eid="DEU 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 11:7"/>Goday oothida ha gita oosota ubbaa hinte, hinte ayfen be7ideta.<verse eid="DEU 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 11:8"/>Hiza hinte mino gidana melanne Yordaanose pinnidi hinte ekanaw biya biitta laattana mela taani hachi hintena kiittiya kiita ubbaa naagite. <verse eid="DEU 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 11:9"/>Hinte kiitetiko, Goday hinte mayzatasinne enta kochaas immana gidi caaqida, maathinne eessi goggiya biittan hinte adussa laythi daana. <verse eid="DEU 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 11:10"/>Ne laattanaw biya biittay, ne keyada yida Gibxe biitta mela gidenna. Gibxen ne kathi zerada, goshsha biitta ubbaa atakilte bessada haathe ushshaasa. <verse eid="DEU 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 11:11"/>Shin Yordaanose pinnidi hinte laattanaw biya biittay, dereynne zangaaray de7iya, salo iran aliya biitta. <verse eid="DEU 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 11:12"/>He biittay, Goday ne Xoossay naagiya biitta; laytha doomethaafe bidi laytha wursethaa gakanaw Godaa, ne Xoossaa ayfey iya bolla de7iya biitta.<verse eid="DEU 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 11:13"/>Hessa gisho, Godaa, hinte Xoossaa siiqiko, hinte kumetha wozanapenne hinte kumetha shempuwafe iya goyinniko, taani hachi hintew immiya kiita hinte naagiko, <verse eid="DEU 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 11:14"/>ne kathi, woyney zaytey paconna shiishana mela torchenne sila ira woden woden bukisana. <verse eid="DEU 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 11:15"/>Goday ne mehiyas maata darsana; ne maana; kallana.<verse eid="DEU 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 11:16"/>Hinte wozanaa hara soo zaaridi, hara xoossata goyinnona melanne hokonna mela naagetite. <verse eid="DEU 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 11:17"/>Hessa hinte oothiko, Godaa hanqoy hinte bolla eexana; iray bukonna melanne kathi dolonna mela I saluwa gordana. Hinte Goday hintew immiya lo77o biittafe eeson dhayana.<verse eid="DEU 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 11:18"/>Hiza, ha kiitata hinte wozanaaninne hinte qofan wothite. Mallada enta hinte kushen qachite; qassi hinte som7on qachite. <verse eid="DEU 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 11:19"/>Hinte nayta tamaarsite. Hinte son de7iya wode, ogen hemetiya wode, zin7iya wodenne dendiya wode entaw odite. <verse eid="DEU 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 11:20"/>Hinte penge zizgiya bollanne hinte dirsa pengiya bolla xaafite. <verse eid="DEU 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 11:21"/>Hessa hinte oothiko, Goday hinte mayzatas immana gidi caaqida biittan, hinte laythaynne hinte nayta laythay sa7ape bollara de7iya salo mela gidana.<verse eid="DEU 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 11:22"/>Hinte Godaa, hinte Xoossaa dosiko, iya oge ubban hinte biiko, iyaw ammanetiko, ta hachi hintew immiya kiita hinte minthidi naagiko, <verse eid="DEU 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 11:23"/>Goday ha kawotethata ubbaa hinte sinthafe gooddidi kessana. Hintefe dariyanne wolqaamiya kawotethata biitta yegisidi ekana. <verse eid="DEU 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 11:24"/>Tohon hinte yedhida biitta ubbay hintebaa gidana. Hinte zaway dugeha mela biittafe bidi Libaanose gakanawunne Efraxiisa shaafape bidi Gita Abbaa gakanaw gidana. <verse eid="DEU 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 11:25"/>Hintera ay asika eqetanaw danda7enna; Goday, hinte Xoossay hintew gidaysada hinte biya soo ubban asay hintena be7idi dagammana melanne hintew yayyana mela oothana.<verse eid="DEU 11:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 11:26"/>Heko, ta hachi hinte sinthan anjonne baadethi wothayis. <verse eid="DEU 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 11:27"/>Ta hachi hintena kiittiya Godaa, hinte Xoossaa kiita naagiko, hinte anjetana. <verse eid="DEU 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 11:28"/>Shin taani hintena hachi kiittiya Godaa, hinte Xoossaa kiita naagonna ixidi, hara xoossata goyinnanaw iya ogiyape deshiko, hinte baadetana. <verse eid="DEU 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 11:29"/>Goday, hinte Xoossay hinte laattanaw biya biitta hintena gelsiya wode, baadetha Garzaana zuma bolla, anjuwa Ebaala zuma bolla awaajite. <verse eid="DEU 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 11:30"/>Ha zumate Yordaanose shaafape hefinthan ogiyape wuloha baggan, Araban de7iya Kanaaneta biittan, Galgala sinthan de7iya Moore mitha matan de7oosona. <verse eid="DEU 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 11:31"/>Hinte ha77i Goday, hinte Xoossay hintew immiya biitta laattanaw Yordaanose shaafa pinnana haneeta. Hinte he biitta ekidi yan de7iya wode, <verse eid="DEU 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 11:32"/>ta hachi hintew immiya awaajotanne higgiya ubbaa minthidi naagite.<verse eid="DEU 11:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="DEU 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Goday Doorida Goyinno Bessa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 12:1"/>Hinte laattana mela Goday, hinte aawata Xoossay hintew immida biittan hinte de7ida wode ubban hinte oothanaw bessiya awaajotinne higgeti haysata. <verse eid="DEU 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 12:2"/>Hinte laattiya biittan de7iya kawotethatis deriya bolla, zumaa bollanne issi issi mitha garsan de7iya goyinno bessata dhaysite. <verse eid="DEU 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 12:3"/>Enta yarsho bessata laallite; enta goyinno shucha tuussata mentherethite. Asheera geetetiya enta eeqa misiliya taman xuuggite; kushen oosetida enta xoossata misileta dhaysite; enta sunthata he bessaafe quchite.<verse eid="DEU 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 12:4"/>Godaa, hinte Xoossaa enti banta xoossaa goyinniya ogen goyinnofite. <verse eid="DEU 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 12:5"/>Goday, hinte Xoossay hinte koche ubbaa giddofe ba sunthay yan xeegetana mela doorida bessaa koyte. He bessaa hinte baanaw koshshees. <verse eid="DEU 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 12:6"/>Hinte xuussa yarshuwa, hara yarshuwa, hinte asraata, hinte imuwa, hinte qangetha, hinte dosidi immiya imuwa, hinte mehiyapenne dorsaafe bayraa he bessaa ehite. <verse eid="DEU 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 12:7"/>Goday, hinte Xoossay hintena anjida gisho, hessan, Goday, hinte Xoossay de7iya bessan, hintenne hinte soo asay maana; hinte kushey oothidaba ubban hinte ufaytana.<verse eid="DEU 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 12:8"/>Hachi haysan hinte issoy issoy, dosidaba ootheysada he wode ootheketa. <verse eid="DEU 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 12:9"/>Goday, hinte Xoossay hintew immiya shempo biitta buroo gakibeketa. <verse eid="DEU 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 12:10"/>Shin hinte Yordaanose pinnidi, Goday hinte Xoossay immiya he biitta laattidi yan uttana. Hintena teqida morketape I hintena shempisiya gisho yan wopu gidi hinte daana. <verse eid="DEU 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 12:11"/>He wode Goday, hinte Xoossay ba sunthay hessan xeegetanaw doorida he bessan, ta hintena kiittiyaba ubbaa, xuussa yarshuwa, hara yarshuwa, hinte asraata, hinte imuwanne hinte qangetha ubbaa yaa eheeta. <verse eid="DEU 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 12:12"/>Hinte, hinte adde naytinne hinte macca nayti, hinte adde aylletinne macca aylleti hintera laata ekiboonna hinte kataman de7iya Leewetara issife yan Godaa, hinte Xoossaa sinthan ufaytana. <verse eid="DEU 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 12:13"/>Neeni xuussa yarshuwa ne koyida bessan coo yarshonna mela naageta. <verse eid="DEU 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 12:14"/>Neeni, ne kochaafe issuwan, Goday doorida bessan, ne xuussa yarshuwa yarsha; ta nena kiitida ubbaa yan ootha.<verse eid="DEU 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 12:15"/>Gidoshin ne de7iya bessan awunka ne mehiyape Goday nena anjidaysada shukada ma. Wogaada tuna gidin woyko tuna gidonna asi oonika gaaranne gen7e meysada ne mehiyape shukada ma. <verse eid="DEU 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 12:16"/>Shin suuthi haathada sa7an gussafe attishin, moopa. <verse eid="DEU 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 12:17"/>Ne kathaafe, woyniyapenne zaytiyape immiya asraata, ne mehiyapenne dorsa wudiyape immiya bayraa, Godaas qangidaba ubbaanne ne dosan immiya imuwa ubbaa ne de7iya heeran moopa. <verse eid="DEU 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 12:18"/>Shin neeni, ne adde naytinne ne macca nayti, ne adde aylletinne macca aylleti neera laata ekiboonna ne kataman de7iya Leewetara issife Goday, ne Xoossay doorida bessan, Godaa, ne Xoossaa sinthan, ha yarsho ubbaa ma. Ne daaburada shiishidaban Godaa, ne Xoossaa sinthan ufayta. <verse eid="DEU 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 12:19"/>Ne de7o laytha ubban Leeweta qelli goonna mela naageta.<verse eid="DEU 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 12:20"/>I new gelida qaalada Goday ne Xoossay ne zawa daligisiya wode nena asho maanaw koshshiya wode ne koyida mela ma. <verse eid="DEU 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 12:21"/>Shin Goday, ne Xoossay ba sunthay yan xeegetana mela doorida bessay new haakiko, Goday new immida ne mehe woyko dorsaa wudiyape ta nena kiittidaysada, ne koyida mela ne kataman shukada ma. <verse eid="DEU 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 12:22"/>Wogaada tuna gidin woyko tuna gidonna asi oonika gaara woyko gen7e meysada mo. <verse eid="DEU 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 12:23"/>De7oy suuthan de7iya gisho, suuthi de7iya asho moonna mela naageta; hessa gisho, de7o ashora gathada moopa. <verse eid="DEU 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 12:24"/>Suuthi haathada biittan gussafe attishin, moopa. <verse eid="DEU 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 12:25"/>Newunne neepe guyera yaana ne naytas injetana mela suuthi moopa. Hessa ne oothiko Godaa ufaysaasa.<verse eid="DEU 12:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 12:26"/>Shin ne Godaas dummayidabaanne iyaw qangidaba ekada, Goday doorida bessaa ba. <verse eid="DEU 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 12:27"/>Xuussa yarsho ashuwanne suuthaa Godaa, ne Xoossaa yarsho bessan yarsha. Hara yarsho suuthaa Godaa, ne Xoossaa yarsho bessa matan gussada ashuwa ma. <verse eid="DEU 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 12:28"/>Newunne ne naytas injetana mela ta nena kiittiya kiitaa minthada naaga. Hessa ne oothiko, Godaa ne Xoossaa ufaysiyabaanne suureba oothaasa.<verse eid="DEU 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 12:29"/>Ne laattanaw biya kawotethaa, Goday ne Xoossay ne sinthafe dhaysiya wodenne ne enta biitta laattiya wode, <verse eid="DEU 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 12:30"/>enti ne sinthafe dhaydaape guye, ne enta xoossata goyinnada, xihen oyketonna mela naageta. Neeni, “Ha kawotethati banta xoossata waatidi goyinnona?” yaagada kaallada oychonna mela naageta. <verse eid="DEU 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 12:31"/>Enti banta xoossata goyinniya wode Goday ixiya ubbaa oothiya gisho, Godaa ne Xoossaa ne hessada goyinnanaw bessenna. Enti hari attoshin, banta adde naytanne macca nayta banta xoossatas yarsho oothidi taman xuuggoosona.<verse eid="DEU 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 12:32"/>Hiza ta nena kiittidaba ubbaa ootha; iya bolla gujofa; iyape pacisopa.<verse eid="DEU 12:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="DEU 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Hara Xoossata Goyinnofa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 13:1"/>Ne giddon tinbite odiya woyko amuho birshiya asi dendidi, malaatanne malaalsiyabata oothiko, <verse eid="DEU 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 13:2"/>I odida malaatay woyko malaalsiyabay tuma gididi poletin, I neeko, “Ane kase ne eronna hara xoossata goyinnoos” yaagiko, <verse eid="DEU 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 13:3"/>ne iya ubbaraka si7opa. Hinte kumetha wozanapenne kumetha shempuwafe Godaa hinte Xoossaa dosiyakonne dosonaako paacanaw hessa oothees. <verse eid="DEU 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 13:4"/>Godaa hinte Xoossaa kaallite; iyaw yayyite; iya kiita naagite; iya qaala si7ite; iyaw goyinnite; iyape duuxofite. <verse eid="DEU 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 13:5"/>Hintena Gibxe aylletethaafe wozida Godaa, hinte Xoossaa bolla hinte makallana mela tamaarsiya nabe woyko amuho birshiya uraa wodhite. Hessa mela asi hinte Godaa, hinte Xoossa kiitaape kare keyana mela oothiya gisho, iya wodhite; iitaa hinte giddofe diggite.<verse eid="DEU 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 13:6"/>Hari attoshin, ne ishay woyko ne adde na7ay woyko ne macca na7iya woyko ne dosiya machiya woyko ne mata laggey, “Kase nenne ne mayzati goyinni eronna xoossata goyinnanaw yedha. <verse eid="DEU 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 13:7"/>Biittaa ha gaxape ya gaxaa gakanaw de7iya, ne yuusho ubban mataninne haahon de7iya asa ubbay goyinniya xoossata goyinnanaw yedha” yaagidi balethiko, <verse eid="DEU 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 13:8"/>iyaw ero goopa; I geysa si7opa. Iyaw qadhetada iya shempuwa ashshofa; <verse eid="DEU 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 13:9"/>iya wodhanaw bessees. Iya wodhanaw koyro ne dooma; hessafe guye, asa ubbay kaallidi wodho. <verse eid="DEU 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 13:10"/>I hayqana gakanaw shuchan cadda; I nena Gibxe biittafe, aylletetha keethaafe kessida Godaa, ne Xoossaafe nena shaakanaw koyees. <verse eid="DEU 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 13:11"/>Isra7eele asay hessa si7idi yayyana; qassi hessa mela iitabaa zaaridi hinte giddon oonika oothenna.<verse eid="DEU 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 13:12"/>Goday, ne Xoossay ne daana mela immida katamaape issuwan ne de7iya wode, <verse eid="DEU 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 13:13"/>ne asaa giddon iitati dendidi, asaako, “Nuuni eronna xoossata goyinnanaw dendite” yaagidi balethishin ne si7iko, <verse eid="DEU 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 13:14"/>he hanota oycha; minthada pilga. He ne giddon oosetida tunabay tuma gideysa shaakada eriko, <verse eid="DEU 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 13:15"/>he kataman de7iya asa ubbaa mashshan wursa; he katamaanne iyan de7iya mehiya ashshona dhaysa. <verse eid="DEU 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 13:16"/>He katamaape ne ekida di7o ubbaa katamaa dabaaba shiishada, he katamaanne iya di7uwa ubbaa Godaas, ne Xoossaas, xuussa yarsho oothada wursada xuugga. I merinaw zaaridi keexetonna laaletha doore gididi attana. <verse eid="DEU 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 13:17"/>Ha digetida miishetape aybika ne kushen bentofo. Goday ba wolqaama hanquwafe simmidi, nena maarana; I new qadhetana. Kase ne mayzatas caaqida caaquwada ne taybuwa darsana. <verse eid="DEU 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 13:18"/>Taani hachi nena kiittiya kiita ubbaa ne naagada, Godaa, ne Xoossaas kiitetiko, Godaa ne Xoossaa ufaysiyabaa oothiko, ha gidabay new poletana.<verse eid="DEU 13:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="DEU 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Tunanne Tuna Gidonna Kathi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 11:1-47">Leewe 11:1-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 14:1"/>Hinte, Godaa hinte Xoossaa nayta; hayqida asaas hinte asatethaa gaaropite; hinte huuphiya buluusopite. <verse eid="DEU 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 14:2"/>Hinte, Godaa hinte Xoossaas geeshsha dere; Goday hintena ba ase gidana mela biittan de7iya asa ubbaafe baw dooris.<verse eid="DEU 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 14:3"/>Neeni tunaba aybaka moopa. <verse eid="DEU 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 14:4"/>Ne maana mehetinne do7ati haysata; boori, dorse, deeshe, <verse eid="DEU 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 14:5"/>doge, baacho, woshi7e, wora deeshi, waaliya, gaaranne zuma dorse. <verse eid="DEU 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 14:6"/>Shuquley phalqetidaysanne waammotiya mehetanne do7ata ubbaa miite. <verse eid="DEU 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 14:7"/>Shin shuquley phalqetonaysatanne waammotonnayisata moopa; hessika gimale, eshenne gupalle. Haysati waammotoosona, shin enta shuquley phalqetiboona gisho, enti hintew tuna. <verse eid="DEU 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 14:8"/>Gudunthos shuquley phalqethi, shin waammotonna gisho I hintew tuna. Iya ashuwa moopa; iya bawuta bochofite.<verse eid="DEU 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 14:9"/>Haatha giddon de7iya medhetethata giddofe hinte maanaysati haysata; molo mela qefeynne poqoy de7iya ubbaa miite. <verse eid="DEU 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 14:10"/>Shin molo mela qefeynne poqoy baynayisata moopite hessi hintew tuna.<verse eid="DEU 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 14:11"/>Tuna gidonna kafo ubbaa miite. <verse eid="DEU 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 14:12"/>Shin kafotape hinte moonna aggana kafoti haysata; arganthi, bazzo anko, kareetha anko, <verse eid="DEU 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 14:13"/>phirco, xilo koche ubbaa, <verse eid="DEU 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 14:14"/>qoorase koche ubbaa, <verse eid="DEU 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 14:15"/>yancho, haatha kafo, qamma kafo koche ubbaa, <verse eid="DEU 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 14:16"/>laafa gutto, diidinthe, haatha kutto, <verse eid="DEU 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 14:17"/>bazzo gutto, molo kafo, solee, hazazo, <verse eid="DEU 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 14:18"/>saabisa geetetiya kafo koche ubbaa, ayyaana kafonne shirshiqo. <verse eid="DEU 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 14:19"/>Qefera de7iya laafa medhetethati ubbay hintew tuna; enta moopite. <verse eid="DEU 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 14:20"/>Shin qefera de7iyabatape tuna gidonayisata miite.<verse eid="DEU 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 14:21"/>Neeni, Godaa ne Xoossaas geeshsha asi gidiya gisho, bawuta ubbaa moopa. Hessa hinte kataman de7iya bete asay maana mela entaw immanaw danda7eeta; woyko hara biitta asas bayzanaw danda7eeta.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 14:21">Deesha na7a iya aaye maathara kathofa.<verse eid="DEU 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asraata Imo Woga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 14:22"/>Ne gaden laythan laythan kaxiya katha ayfe ubbaafe asraata kessa. <verse eid="DEU 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 14:23"/>Ne ubba wode Godaas ne Xoossaas, yashshi tamaarana mela ba sunthay xeegetana mela I doorida bessan, ne kathaa, woyne ushshaanne zaytiya asraata, ne dorsafenne mehiyape bayra yeletidaysa yan, Godaa, ne Xoossaa sinthan ma. <verse eid="DEU 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 14:24"/>Goday ne Xoossay ba sunthay xeegetana mela doorida bessay, ne de7iya bessaafe daro haaho gidiko, Goday nena anjana mela ne asraata yaa efanaw danda7onnaba gidiko, <verse eid="DEU 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 14:25"/>he asraata bayzada miishiya Goday, ne Xoossay doorida bessaa efa. <verse eid="DEU 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 14:26"/>He miishiyan ne koyida miizi woyko dorse woyko woyne ushshi woyko hara mino ushshi woyko hara ne koyiyaba shammada, nenne ne soo asay Godaa, ne Xoossaa sinthan hessa mada ufayta.<verse eid="DEU 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 14:27"/>Enti neera shaaketidi ekida hara laati entaw bayna gisho, hessa ne oothiya wode ne kataman de7iya Leeweta dogopa. <verse eid="DEU 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 14:28"/>Heedzantho laythan laythan ne katha asraata ehada ne kataman shiisha. <verse eid="DEU 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 14:29"/>Hessa ne kataman de7iya, neera shaakitidi ekida hara laati bayna Leeweti, bete asay, yi7o naytinne am7eti yidi mo. Yaatiko, ne oothiya ooso ubban Goday, ne Xoossay nena anjana.<verse eid="DEU 14:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="DEU 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Laapuntha Laythi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 25:1-7">Leewe 25:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 15:1"/>“Laapuntha laytha wursethan tal7e aco ubbaa maara. <verse eid="DEU 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 15:2"/>Ne aco maarana wogay haysa; Isra7eele gidida ba ishaas tal7ida oonika he acuwa maaro. Godaa maarotethay awaajetida gisho, Isra7eele gidida ba ishaas tal7ida ba tal7iya oychofo. <verse eid="DEU 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 15:3"/>Hara biitta asas ne tal7ida acuwa ekanaw danda7aasa, shin ne kochaas tal7idaba ubbaa maara.<verse eid="DEU 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 15:4"/>“Ne laattana mela Goday, ne Xoossay new aqo oothidi immiya biittan, Goday nena anjana gisho ne giddon manqoy deenna. <verse eid="DEU 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 15:5"/>Ne Godaas ne Xoossaas kiitetiko, ta hachi nena kiittiya kiita ubbaa naagiko, ne polo anjetana. <verse eid="DEU 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 15:6"/>Goday, ne Xoossay new odidaysada nena anjana; daro kawotethati hintefe tal7ana, shin hinte issuwafeka tal7eketa. Qassi ne kawotethata haarana, shin issoyka nena haarenna.<verse eid="DEU 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 15:7"/>“Goday, ne Xoossay new immiya biittan de7iya katamatape issuwan de7iya Isra7eele asi manqidi bentiko, iyaw ulo minnofa; ne kushiya shiisha ekofa. <verse eid="DEU 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 15:8"/>Ne kushiya iyaw birsha; iya koshshiyaba tal7a.<verse eid="DEU 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 15:9"/>“Aco maariya laapuntha laythi matis” gada, manqo Isra7eele asi tal7e diggofa; hessa mela iita qofi ne wozanan gelopo. Ne iyaw tal7onna ixin, I Xoossako yeekiko, hessi new nagara gidana. <verse eid="DEU 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 15:10"/>Ne iyaw keehatethan imma; ne wozanan ayis immiyana gada uuzettofa. Hessa ne oothiko, Goday ne Xoossay nena oykidaban yedhidaban ubban anjana. <verse eid="DEU 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 15:11"/>Awudeka gidin, biitta bollafe manqoy dhayonna gisho, ne Isra7eeletas, manqotasinne metootanchotas hinte keeha gidana mela kiittayis.<verse eid="DEU 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Aylleta Oytha Woga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 21:1-11">Kessa 21:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 15:12"/>Adde gidin macca gidin, Isra7eele asi, aylle oothidi shammiko, I new usupun laythi ootho; laapuntha laythan aylletethafe la77a keyo. <verse eid="DEU 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 15:13"/>Neeni aylletethaafe iya kessa yeddiya wode mela kushe yeddofa. <verse eid="DEU 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 15:14"/>Goday ne Xoossay nena anjidaysa mela ne mehiyape, shaaliyapenne woyne gum7ethaafe entaw keehatethan imma. <verse eid="DEU 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 15:15"/>Neeni kase Gibxe biittan aylle gididaysanne Goday ne Xoossay nena yaape wozidaysa dogopa. Ta hachi ha kiitaa new immey hessasa.<verse eid="DEU 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 15:16"/>Shin ne aylley nenanne ne keetha asaa dosida gishonne neera de7oy iyaw lo77o gidiya gisho, “Taani ne soope biike” yaagiko, <verse eid="DEU 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 15:17"/>iya penge efada, goothi ekada, iya haytha luka. Yaatiko, I new merinaw aylle gidana; qassi macca aylleska hessada ootha. <verse eid="DEU 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 15:18"/>Iya neeni aylletethaafe kessada yeddiya wode neeni qohetas gada qopofa. I ha usupun laythata giddon asi une ootheysafe dako daro new oothis. Hessa gisho, neeni oothiyaba ubban Goday, ne Xoossay nena anjana.<verse eid="DEU 15:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bayra Yeletiya Marata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 15:19"/>Ne mehiyapenne ne dorsaa wudiyape bayra yeletida adde ubbaa Godaas, ne Xoossaas dummaya. Ne dummayida mehiyape bayra yeletida boora goyopa; ne dorsaa wudiyape bayra yeletida dorsaa ikisiya meedopa. <verse eid="DEU 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 15:20"/>Nenne ne soo asay Goday dooriya bessan Godaa, ne Xoossaa sinthan hessata laythan laythan ma. <verse eid="DEU 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 15:21"/>Shin ne yarshiya mehiya bolla borsiyabay bentiko, I wobbe woyko qooqe woyko hara iita borisiyabay iya bolla de7iko, hessa Godaas, ne Xoossaas yarshofa. <verse eid="DEU 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 15:22"/>Hessa ne de7iya ne kataman ma; wogaada tuna gidonna asi gidin woyko tuna asi gidin gaaranne gen7e ashoda mo. <verse eid="DEU 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 15:23"/>Gidoshin, ne iya suuthaa haathada sa7an gussafe attishin, moopa.<verse eid="DEU 15:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="DEU 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Paasika Ba7aale</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 12:1-20">Kessa 12:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 16:1"/>Abiiba ageenan Godaa, ne Xoossaa Paasika Ba7aale boncha; Goday, ne Xoossay nena Abiiba ageenan qamma Gibxefe kessis. <verse eid="DEU 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 16:2"/>Neeni dorsafenne mehe wudiyape Goday ba sunthay xeegetana mela doorida bessan, Godaas, ne Xoossaas, Paasika yarsha. <verse eid="DEU 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 16:3"/>He yarshuwa ne miya wode irshoy gelida uythara moopa. Neeni Gibxe yeddada eeson keyiya wode oothidaysada irshoy geliboonna meto uythaa laapun gallas kumethi ma. Ne de7o laytha ubban ne Gibxefe keyida gallasaa hassayana. <verse eid="DEU 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 16:4"/>Ne biitta ubban laapun gallassas ayba irshoy bentofo. Qassi ne koyro gallas omarsi yarshida ashuwape wontas aybika attofo.<verse eid="DEU 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 16:5"/>Ne Paasika yarshuwa Goday ne Xoossay new immiya katama awunka coo shukofa. <verse eid="DEU 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 16:6"/>Goday ne Xoossay ba sunthay xeegetana mela dooriya bessan ne Paasika yarshuwa shuka. Qassi awi wulliya wode Gibxefe ne keyida gisho he saatiyan shuka. <verse eid="DEU 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 16:7"/>Goday, ne Xoossay dooriya bessan, yan kathada ma; yaatada sa7i wontiya wode ne soo soo ba. <verse eid="DEU 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 16:8"/>Usupun gallas kumethi irshoy geliboonna uythaa ma; laapuntha gallas Godaa, ne Xoossaa goyinnanaw shiiqa; he gallas ay oosoka oothofa.<verse eid="DEU 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Saaminta Ba7aale</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 34:22">Kessa 34:22</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 23:15-21">Leewe 23:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 16:9"/>Ne katha caka oykida koyro wodiyape doomada, laapun saaminta kumethi tayba. <verse eid="DEU 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 16:10"/>Yaatada, Goday, ne Xoossay nena anjidaysa mela ne, ne dosan immiya imuwa ehada, Godaa, ne Xoossaa Saaminta Ba7aale boncha. <verse eid="DEU 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 16:11"/>Hessan neeni, ne adde nayti, ne macca nayti, ne adde aylletinne ne macca aylleti, ne kataman de7iya Leeweti, bete asay, yi7o naytinne ne giddon de7iya am7eti ubbay, Goday, ne Xoossay ba sunthay xeegetana mela dooriya bessan ufaytite. <verse eid="DEU 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 16:12"/>Neeni Gibxe biittan aylle gididaysa hassayada ha wogaa naaga.<verse eid="DEU 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Shaqara Ba7aale</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:33-43">Leewe 23:33-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 16:13"/>Ne wudumaafe ne kathaa, woyne yedhiya bessaafe ne woyniya shiishidaape guye, laapun gallas Shaqara Ba7aale boncha. <verse eid="DEU 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 16:14"/>Neeni, ne adde naytinne macca nayti, ne adde aylletinne macca aylleti, ne kataman de7iya Leeweti, bete asay, yi7o naytinne am7eti ubbay he baaliyan ufaytite. <verse eid="DEU 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 16:15"/>Goday dooriya bessan laapun gallas Godaa, ne Xoossaa, Ba7aale boncha. Ne ufaytana mela ne ayfisidabaninne ne kushe ooso ubban Goday, ne Xoossay nena anjana.<verse eid="DEU 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 16:16"/>Hinte biittan de7iya adde ubbay laythan heedzu toho, Uytha Ba7aale wode, Saaminta Ba7aale wodenne Shaqara Ba7aale wode Godaa, hinte Xoossaa sinthan, I dooriya bessan bento. Enti Godaa sinthe yishe, mela kushe yoopo. <verse eid="DEU 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 16:17"/>Goday, ne Xoossay nena anjidaysa mela issoy issoy baw danda7eysa mela immo.<verse eid="DEU 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xillo pirda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 16:18"/>Goday, hinte Xoossay immiya katamatan issi issi kochaas daynnanne halaqa hintew shuumite; enti asaas xillo pirda pirdo. <verse eid="DEU 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 16:19"/>Xillo pirdaa wobbisopa; som7o be7ada maaddofa; wodhaafe ekofa. Wodhaafey cincata ayfiya qooqisees, xillota qaala geellayees. <verse eid="DEU 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 16:20"/>Ne de7on daana malanne Goday ne Xoossay new immiya biitta ne laattana mela xillo pirda.<verse eid="DEU 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 16:21"/>Neeni Godaa, Xoossaa yarsho bessa matan Asheera eeqa misiliya essofa. <verse eid="DEU 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 16:22"/>Hinte Goday, Xoossay ixiya goyinno shucha tuussu new essofa.<verse eid="DEU 16:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="DEU 17"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 17:1"/>Godaas, ne Xoossaas, borisiyabay de7iya mehe woyko dorse yarsho oothada shiishopa; hessi Xoossa sinthan ixetidaba.<verse eid="DEU 17:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 17:2"/>Goday, ne Xoossay new immiya katamatape awunka adde woyko macca gidin Godaa, ne Xoossaa sinthan iitaba oothikonne iya caaquwa menthidi bentiko, <verse eid="DEU 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 17:3"/>ta kiita aggidi, hara xoossata, awa woyko ageena woyko salo xoolinto goyinnida asi de7iko, <verse eid="DEU 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 17:4"/>hessa melaba hinte si7iko, he odaa minthidi pilga. Hinte koyin, hessa mela tunabay Isra7eele giddon oosetidaysi tumanne geeshshi gidiko, <verse eid="DEU 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 17:5"/>he iitaa oothida addiya woyko maccasiw ne katamaape gaxa kessada, shuchan caddada wodha. <verse eid="DEU 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 17:6"/>Issi asi nam7u woyko heedzu marki markatonna de7ishin hayqofo; issi asa markan ay asika hayqofo. <verse eid="DEU 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 17:7"/>Iya bolla markatida asati koyro iya shuchan caddo; enta kaallidi hanko asay caddo. Hessada oothada, iitaa ne giddofe digga.<verse eid="DEU 17:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 17:8"/>Hinte sinthe shiiqiya mootoy deexo gidiko, hessika, shempo wodho, shoche, madunthi, dumma dumma mootota Goday, ne Xoossay doorida bessaa eha. <verse eid="DEU 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 17:9"/>Kahine gidida Leewetakonne daynnatako he mootuwa shiisha; he mootuwa enti pirdo. <verse eid="DEU 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 17:10"/>Goday doorida bessan enti pirdidaysada ootha; ne oothana mela enti kiittiyaba ubba akeekada ootha. <verse eid="DEU 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 17:11"/>Enti nena tamaarsida higgiyadanne enti odida pirdada ootha; enti pirdida pirdaafe ushachi woyko haddirsi goopa. <verse eid="DEU 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 17:12"/>Godaas, ne Xoossaas oothiya daynnas woyko kahiniyas kiitetonna ixiya asi de7iko, he uray hayqo. Hessada oothada, iitaa Isra7eele giddofe digga. <verse eid="DEU 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 17:13"/>Asa ubbay hessa si7idi yayyana; zaaridi hessa mela iita oothiya asi deenna.<verse eid="DEU 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kawo Xeelliya Wogata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 17:14"/>Goday, ne Xoossay new immiya biitta laattada, yan de7o doomiya wode, ne yuushon de7iya kawotethatada, “Nuka nu bolla kawo kawothana” yaagiko, <verse eid="DEU 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 17:15"/>ne kawothana kawoy Goday, ne Xoossay new dooridaysa gidanaw bessees. Hessika, ne asaa giddofe dooretidaysa gidope attishin, hara biitta asi ne bolla kawothofa. <verse eid="DEU 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 17:16"/>Goday, “He ogiyara Gibxe simmopite” yaagida gisho, he kawoy daro para shiishanaw bessenna; ba asaaka para shammana mela Gibxe yeddofo. <verse eid="DEU 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 17:17"/>Iya wozanaa balethonna mela kawoy daro macco ekofo; daro worqanne bira shiishopo.<verse eid="DEU 17:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 17:18"/>I ba araatan uttiya wode Leewe koche gidida kahineti naagiya maxaafape ha higgiya duuqidi baw eko. <verse eid="DEU 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 17:19"/>I ha higgiya qaalanne wogaa naagonne polo eridi Godaas, ba Xoossaas, yashshi tamaarana mela, ha maxaafay iyara de7o; ika ha maxaafa ba de7o laytha ubban nabbabo. <verse eid="DEU 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 17:20"/>I ba wozanan, “Taani ta laggetape aadhayis” gidi ba ishata bolla otortenna. Ika Xoossaa higgiyafe haddirsi woyko ushachi geenna. I ba kawotethan adussa laythi kawotana; iya nayti Isra7eele biittan daro laythi kawotana.<verse eid="DEU 17:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="DEU 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Kahinetanne Leeweta Gishuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 18:1"/>Leewe koche gidida kahinetasinne attida enta kochaas Isra7eele giddon laata biitti baawa. Asay Godaas shiishiya xuussa yarshoy enta gisho gidiya gisho iya mishe daana. <verse eid="DEU 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 18:2"/>Entaw enta ishata giddon laati deenna; Goday entaw gidaysada I enta laata.<verse eid="DEU 18:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 18:3"/>Korma woyko dorse asay yarshos shiishidaysafe kahineta gishoy haysa; missay, gacoynne ulo ashoy entaw imeto. <verse eid="DEU 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 18:4"/>Ne kathaafe, woyniyapenne zaytiyape koyro gakida ayfiyanne ne dorsa ikisiyape bayraa kahinetas imma. <verse eid="DEU 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 18:5"/>Leeweti Godaa sunthan merinaw kahine gididi oothana mela ne kochaa giddofe Goday, ne Xoossay enta dooris.<verse eid="DEU 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 18:6"/>Issi Leewey Isra7eele biittan de7iya issi katamaape dendidi, Goday dooriya bessaa baanaw koyiko, <verse eid="DEU 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 18:7"/>I biya bessan de7iya Leeweti Godaa sinthan eqidi ootheysada ika Godaa ba Xoossaa sinthan eqidi ootho. <verse eid="DEU 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 18:8"/>Bana gakiya gishuwa ekidaba gidikoka, kahineti go7etiya ubbaa entara gina shaaketidi eko.<verse eid="DEU 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ixetida Oosota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 18:9"/>Goday ne Xoossay immida biitta ne geliya wode he biittan de7iya asay oothiya ixetida oosota oothofa. <verse eid="DEU 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 18:10"/>Ba adde na7aa woyko macca na7iw yarshos taman xuuggiya oonika ne giddon bentofo. Biti, maraace be7ey, marotey, higishey, <verse eid="DEU 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 18:11"/>moytille be7ey, hayqida asa ayyaana xeegey, woyko hayqida asa ayyaanara odetey ne giddon de7opo. <verse eid="DEU 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 18:12"/>Hessa melaba oothiya oonika Godaa matan ixetida asi. Enti hessa mela tunaa oothiya gisho, Goday ne Xoossay he kawotethata ne sinthafe gooddana. <verse eid="DEU 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 18:13"/>Shin neeni Godaa ne Xoossaa sinthan borey baynaysa gida. <verse eid="DEU 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 18:14"/>Neeni laattanaw biya biittan de7iya kawotethati murunneysatanne biteyisata; shin ne hessa oothonna mela Goday ne Xoossay nena diggis.<verse eid="DEU 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossay Denthana Nabiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 18:15"/>Goday, ne Xoossay ne kochaa giddofe ta mela nabe new denthana. Ne I geysa si7a. <verse eid="DEU 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 18:16"/>Koreeba zumaa bolla ne shiiqida wode Godaa ne Xoossaa haysada yaagada oychadasa; “Ta hayqonna mela Godaa, ta Xoossaa girsaa zaarada si7ike; ha wolqaama tama zaarada be7ike” yaagadasa.<verse eid="DEU 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 18:17"/>Goday taako, “Enti tuma gidoosona. <verse eid="DEU 18:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 18:18"/>Ta enta kochaa giddofe ne mela nabe entaw denthana; taani ta qaala iya doonan wothana; i, ta kiittiya ubbaa entaw odana. <verse eid="DEU 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 18:19"/>I ta sunthan odiya ta qaala si7onna oonaka ta oychana. <verse eid="DEU 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 18:20"/>Shin ta kiittonnaba ta sunthan odiya woyko hara xoossata sunthan odiya he nabey hayqo” yaagis.<verse eid="DEU 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 18:21"/>Neeni, “Nabey odiya qaalay Xoossafe gidonnaysa ta aybin shaakada eranee?” yaagiko, <verse eid="DEU 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 18:22"/>he nabey Godaa sunthan odida qaalay poletonna ixiko, hessi Goday odiboonna qaala gideysa eraasa. He nabey odiya qaalay wordo gidida gisho iya yayyofa.<verse eid="DEU 18:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="DEU 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Baqatidi Attiya Katamata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 35:9-34">Taybo 35:9-34</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 20:1-9">Iyya 20:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 19:1"/>Goday, ne Xoossay new immiya biittan de7iya kawotethata dhaysiya wodenne ne enta gooddada, enta katamataninne enta keethatan duussu doomiya wode, <verse eid="DEU 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 19:2"/>Goday, ne Xoossay laata oothidi immiya biittan de7iya katamatape heedzu katamata new dummaya. <verse eid="DEU 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 19:3"/>Goday, ne Xoossay new laata oothidi immiya biitta heedza kessada shaaka. Yaatada ase wodhida oonika he katamatako eeson baqatidi attana mela oge giigisa.<verse eid="DEU 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 19:4"/>Issi asi kase morketethi bayna de7ishin, eronna ba laggiya wodhiko, I he katamatape issuwako baqatidi ba shempuwa ashsho. <verse eid="DEU 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 19:5"/>Nam7u asati mithi qanxanaw wora bin, issoy mithaa qanxishin, mithaafe kalta ayfey koletidi hankuwa wodhiko, wodhida uray ha heedzu katamatape issuwako baqatidi, ba shempuwa asho. <verse eid="DEU 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 19:6"/>Baqatidi attiya katamay issinni xalaala gidiko, wodhida uray eeson woxidi gakanaw ogey adusse gidiko, suuthi zaariya mata dabboy gooddi gakidi, yilon dendidi hayqanaw bessonna uraa wodhanaw danda7ees. I ba laggiya wodhiday kase morketethi de7iya gisho gidenna. <verse eid="DEU 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 19:7"/>Hinte heedzu katamata dummayi wothana mela ta nena kiittey hessasa.<verse eid="DEU 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 19:8"/>Goday, ne Xoossay kase ne mayzatas caaqidaysada ne zawa dalgisikonne ne mayzatas immana gida biitta ubbaa new immiko, <verse eid="DEU 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 19:9"/>ha heedzu katamata bolla hara heedzu katamata guja. Hachi ta nena kiittiya ubbaa ne poliko, Godaa ne Xoossaa dosikonne I nena tamaarsida ogiyan minnada de7iko, ha biittay new imetana. <verse eid="DEU 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 19:10"/>Hessa ne oothiko, Goday, ne Xoossay laata oothidi new immiya biittan xillo asa suuthi gukenna; neka suuthi gussada oyshetaka.<verse eid="DEU 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 19:11"/>Shin issi asi ba shooruwa ixidi, qoseti naagidi iya wodhidi, ha katamatape issuwako baqatiko, <verse eid="DEU 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 19:12"/>I de7iya kataman de7iya cimati I baqatida katamaape ehisidi, kushe zaaranaw koyeysas aathidi immo. <verse eid="DEU 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 19:13"/>Iyaw aybaka qadhetofa; new ubbabay injetana mela, xillo suuthi gussida uraa Isra7eele giddofe digga.<verse eid="DEU 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Markatethaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 19:14"/>Goday ne Xoossay neeni laattana mela immiya biittan, beni asay essida gade zawa shoddofa.<verse eid="DEU 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 19:15"/>Issi asi bala oothanaw issi marka xalaali gidenna. Nam7u woyko heedzu marki markatin, he mootoy pirdetanaw koshshees.<verse eid="DEU 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 19:16"/>Issi asi hara asi wordon mootiko, <verse eid="DEU 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 19:17"/>mooteysinne mooteteysi nam7ay Godaa sinthan, kahineta sinthaninne daynnata sinthan eqo. <verse eid="DEU 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 19:18"/>Daynnati he odaa minthidi pilgo; he uray ba ishaa wordon mooteysi tuma gidiko, <verse eid="DEU 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 19:19"/>he mooteteysi ekanaw de7iya seera mooteysi seereto. Hessada oothada, iita uraa ne giddofe digga. <verse eid="DEU 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 19:20"/>Hessada oothiko, hara asay hessa si7idi yayyana; hessa mela iita oosoy zaaridi oosetenna. <verse eid="DEU 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 19:21"/>Hessa mela iita ooso oothidaysas qadhetofa; shempo gisho shempo; ayfe gisho ayfe; acha gisho ache; kushe gisho kushe; gedaa gisho gedaa mentha.<verse eid="DEU 19:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="DEU 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Olaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 20:1"/>Neeni morketara oletanaw biya wode, enta parati, para gaaretinne enta olanchoti neepe darin be7ada, entaw yayyofa; nena Gibxefe kessida Goday, ne Xoossay neera de7ees. <verse eid="DEU 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 20:2"/>Hinte ola doomanaape koyro, kahiney olanchota sinthe aadhidi haysada yaago; <verse eid="DEU 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 20:3"/>“Isra7eele asaw, si7ite; hachi hinte, hinte morketara oletanaw haneeta. Hiza hinte wozanay dagammofo; yayyofite; enta sinthan kokoropite; hirgofite. <verse eid="DEU 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 20:4"/>Goday, hinte Xoossay hintera biya gisho, hinte morketa olidi, hintew xoono immana” yaago.<verse eid="DEU 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 20:5"/>Toora moconati olanchotako, “Ooratha keethi keexidi geliboonna asi de7iko, I olan hayqin, hara asi iya keethan gelonna mela I soo simmo. <verse eid="DEU 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 20:6"/>Woyko woyne tokidi, ayfe moonna asi de7iko, I olan hayqin, hara asi iya woyne ayfiya moonna mela I soo simmo. <verse eid="DEU 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 20:7"/>Macho oychidi ekiboonna asi de7iko, I olan hayqin, hara asi iya machiw ekonna mela I soo simmo” yaago. <verse eid="DEU 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 20:8"/>Olaa kaaletheysati gujidi haysada yaago; “Ha asaa giddon yayyanne hirgiya oonika de7iko, I ba laggeta wozanaa yashshan til7isanaape soo simmo” yaago. <verse eid="DEU 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 20:9"/>Olaa kaalethaysati hessa asaas odi wursiya wode cugaas cugaas toora moconata dooro.<verse eid="DEU 20:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 20:10"/>Issi katamaa olanaw bada ne iyako matiya wode, koyrottidi sarora enti kushe immana mela oycha. <verse eid="DEU 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 20:11"/>Enti sarora banta kushiya immidi, banta gimbe pengiya dooyidi nena gelsiko, he kataman de7iya asa ubbay new deexo ooso oothidi haggaazo. <verse eid="DEU 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 20:12"/>He katamaa asay new sarora kushe immonna ixidi, olas giigetiko, ne he katamaa yuushuwa teqa. <verse eid="DEU 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 20:13"/>Goday, ne Xoossay enta new aathidi immiya wode he kataman de7iya adde ubbaa mashshan wursa. <verse eid="DEU 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 20:14"/>Gidoshin, maccasa, nayta, mehiyanne kataman de7iya ubbaba new di77a. Goday, ne Xoossay new immiya ne morketa shaluwa go7eta. <verse eid="DEU 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 20:15"/>Ne de7iya bessaafe haakidi de7iya katamata ne oykiya wode hessada ootha.<verse eid="DEU 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 20:16"/>Shin Goday, ne Xoossay new laata oothidi immiya biittan shempora de7iyaba issuwaka ashshona wodha. <verse eid="DEU 20:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 20:17"/>Goday, ne Xoossay kiittidaysada Hiteta, Amooreta, Kanaaneta, Parzeta, Hiwetanne Yaabuseta wursada wodha. <verse eid="DEU 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 20:18"/>Hessi hanonna ixiko, enti banta xoossata goyinnishe oothiya ixetida oosota hinte oothana mela hintena tamaarsidi, Godaa hinte Xoossaa bolla hinte nagara oothana mela denthethana.<verse eid="DEU 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 20:19"/>Issi katama oykanaw yuushuwa ne teqada, daro gallas oletashe gam7iya wode, iyan de7iya ayfe immiya mithaa ayfiya mape attishin, qanxofa. Ne yuushuwa teqidi oley asepe attishin, denban de7iya mithaa gidenna. <verse eid="DEU 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 20:20"/>Gidoshin, ne ayfe immonna hara mithata qanxada, neera oletiya katamay kundana gakanaw yan miixa keexa.<verse eid="DEU 20:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="DEU 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Wodhida Uray Eretonna Hayqo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 21:1"/>Ne laattana mela Goday, ne Xoossay new immiya biittan, ooni wodhidaako eretonna ahi kundidi bentiko, <verse eid="DEU 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 21:2"/>hinte daynnatinne cimati bidi, ahay kundida bessaafe mata katamata gakanaw de7iya haahotetha wadho. <verse eid="DEU 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 21:3"/>Hessafe guye, ahay kundida bessaas matiya katamaa cimati, wadhetaboonnanne morgen qambari wodhiboonna ussi eko. <verse eid="DEU 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 21:4"/>Iyo goggiya haathi de7iya goyetidi eronnanne zeretidi eronna zangaara efidi, he ussee qoodhiya mirqidi mentho. <verse eid="DEU 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 21:5"/>Hessa mela qohuwanne ooshsha shaakidi pirdanaw Goday, hinte Xoossay ba sinthan oothana melanne ba sunthan anjana mela enta doorida gisho, Leewe koche gidida kahineti he bessaa boo. <verse eid="DEU 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 21:6"/>Hessafe guye, ahay kundida bessaas matiya katamaa cimati zangaaran qoodhe mirqidi wodhida ussee bolla banta kushiya meecetidi, <verse eid="DEU 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 21:7"/>“Nu kushey ha suuthaa gussibeenna; nu ayfey hessa be7ibeenna. <verse eid="DEU 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 21:8"/>Abeeti Godaw, neeni wozida ne asaa, Isra7eele maara; ha xillo suuthaa ne asaa bolla naaqo oothada taybopa. Ha xillo suuthaa gisho nu nagaray atto ga” yaago. <verse eid="DEU 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 21:9"/>Neeni Godaa ayfiya sinthan hessada oothada, xillo suuthay gukida nagara ne giddofe digga.<verse eid="DEU 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Olan Di7etida Maccasataba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 21:10"/>Ne morketara ne oletanaw keyin, Goday, ne Xoossay enta ne kushen aathidi immin, enta di7iya wode, <verse eid="DEU 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 21:11"/>di7etida asaa giddon issi mala lo7o maccas be7ada, iw mishetada machanaw koyiko, <verse eid="DEU 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 21:12"/>iyo ne soo eha. I huuphiya meeda; I xuguntha cigga; <verse eid="DEU 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 21:13"/>di7etiya wode de7iya ma7uwa laammada, issi ageena ne son uttada, ba aawasinne ba aayes kayoto. Hessafe guye, iyo macha. <verse eid="DEU 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 21:14"/>Yaata simmada, iira duussay nena ufaysonna ixiko, iya ba koyida soo baana mela iyo yedda. Neeni iyo macho oothada iira issife aqida gisho, iyo miishen bayzanaw woyko aylle oothanaw bessenna.<verse eid="DEU 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bayra Na7a Laata Maata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 21:15"/>Issi asas I dosiyanne dosonna nam7u macheti de7iko, he nam7ayka iyaw adde na7a yeliko, bayray I dosonna macceepe yeletidaba gidiko, <verse eid="DEU 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 21:16"/>I ba nayta ba shaluwa laatisiya wode, I dosonnaripe yeletida bayray de7ishin, I dosiyaripe yeletida kaaluwa bayrayanaw bessenna. <verse eid="DEU 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 21:17"/>Hara naytas immeysafe iyaw nam7u kushe aathidi immidi I dosonnari na7ay bayra gideysa erisanaw bessees. He na7ay iyaw kushe toho phalqida bayra gidiya gisho, bayratetha I ekanaw bessees.<verse eid="DEU 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dumma Dumma Higgeta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 21:18"/>Aawasinne aayes kiitetonna ixida, enti seerinka simmonna, wozana muumenne makallancho gidida na7i de7iko, <verse eid="DEU 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 21:19"/>aawaynne aayiya he katamaa pengen de7iya cimatako iya eho. <verse eid="DEU 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 21:20"/>Enti cimatako, “Haysi nu na7ay wozana muumenne makallancho; I nuus kiitetenna; I yarambanne ushshancho” yaagidi odo. <verse eid="DEU 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 21:21"/>Hessafe guye, he kataman de7iya adde ubbay iya shuchan caddidi wodho. Hessada oothidi hinte giddofe iita uraa dhaysite; Isra7eele ubbay hessa si7idi yayyana.<verse eid="DEU 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 21:22"/>Issi asi hayqo pirdisiya bala oothiko, ne iya mitha bolla kaqada wodhiko, <verse eid="DEU 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 21:23"/>he mithaa bolla iya ahay aqopo; iya he gallas mooga. Mitha bolla kaqetidi hayqiya oonika Xoossan baadetidaysa. Goday, ne Xoossay new laata oothidi immiya ne biitta tunisopa.<verse eid="DEU 21:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="DEU 22"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 22:1"/>Isra7eele asa boori woyko dorsi dhayidi bishin demmiko agga aadhofa; laagga ehada iya godaas imma. <verse eid="DEU 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 22:2"/>He mehiya goday ne heera asi gidonna ixiko woyko iya goday ooneko ne eronna ixiko, iya goday koyishe yaana gakanaw ne soo efa; I koyishe yiiko iyaw imma. <verse eid="DEU 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 22:3"/>Hessada hare woyko ma7o woyko aybaka dhayidabaa demmiko, hessada ootha.<verse eid="DEU 22:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 22:4"/>Isra7eele asa harey woyko boori ogen kundin be7iko, maaddada denthafe attishin, aggada aadhofa.<verse eid="DEU 22:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 22:5"/>Maccasi adde ma7o ma7ofo; addeyka maccasa ma7o ma7ofo. Hessa melaba oothiya oonaka Goday, hinte Xoossay ixees.<verse eid="DEU 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 22:6"/>Ne oge bishin, mitha bolla gidin, sa7an ba na7aa woyko ba phuuphulliya haphida kafo demmiko, iyo, I naytara oykada ne soo efopa. <verse eid="DEU 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 22:7"/>Nayta efanaw danda7aasa; shin aayiw baana mela yedda agga. Hessada oothiko, neeni duretada adussa laythi daana.<verse eid="DEU 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 22:8"/>Ooratha keethi keexiya wode kaarape asi kundi hayqin ne oyshetonna mela keetha bolla kate giigisa.<verse eid="DEU 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 22:9"/>Ne woyne gaden nam7u qommo kathi zeropa; hessada oothiko, ne zerida kathaynne woyney nam7ayka iitana.<verse eid="DEU 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 22:10"/>Boorinne hare issife waaxada goyopa.<verse eid="DEU 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 22:11"/>Suufepenne liinope oosetida ma7o ma7ofa.<verse eid="DEU 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 22:12"/>Ne ma7iya ma7oy oyddu baggara macari de7iyaba gido.<verse eid="DEU 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Eko Gelo Geeshshatethi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 22:13"/>Issi asi macho eki simmidi iyo dosona ixidi, <verse eid="DEU 22:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 22:14"/>“Ha machiw ta ekiya wode kumethi giduku” yaagidi iyo iissidi odetiko, <verse eid="DEU 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 22:15"/>na7e aawaynne na7e aayiya I geela7otetha malla efidi, katamaa pengen de7iya cimata besso. <verse eid="DEU 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 22:16"/>Na7e aaway cimatas haysada yaagidi odo; “Taani ta na7iw ha uraas macho oothada immas, shin I, iyo ixis. <verse eid="DEU 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 22:17"/>I, ‘Ne na7iya kumethi giduku’ yaagidi iyo iissidi odis. Gidoshin, ‘Ta na7e geela7otetha mallaa haysa be7ite’ ” yaagidi, I geela7otetha erisiya carqiya besso. <verse eid="DEU 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 22:18"/>Yaatiko, he katamaa cimati iya garaafo. <verse eid="DEU 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 22:19"/>I Isra7eele geela7e sunthaa iissida gisho, cimati iya xeetu bira santime<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:19 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Xeetu bira santime: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Issi kilonne bagga giraame deexiya bira santime </char></note> acisidi, na7e aawas immo. Na7iya iyaw macho gidada de7o; ba de7o laytha ubban iyo yeddanaw bessenna.<verse eid="DEU 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 22:20"/>Iya mootoy tuma gididi, na7iya kumethi gidonna ixiko, <verse eid="DEU 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 22:21"/>iya ba aawa son de7ashe laymatida gisho, na7iw I aawa kare ehidi, he katamaa addeti iyo shuchan caddidi wodho. Isra7eele giddon iya borsoba oothasu; hessada oothada ne giddofe iitaa digga.<verse eid="DEU 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 22:22"/>Issi asi hara asa machira laymatishe oyketiko, inne iyara laymatida maccasiya hayqo. Hessada oothada ne giddofe iitaa digga.<verse eid="DEU 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 22:23"/>Issi asi hara asas oysheta giigida geela7iw katama giddon demmidi iira laymatiko, <verse eid="DEU 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 22:24"/>enta nam7aa katamape gaxa kessidi, shuchan caddidi wodhite. Na7iya hayqey, katama giddon de7ashe, asi ashshana mela waassaboonna gishosa. Na7ay hayqey, hara asas giigida geela7iw iissida gishosa. Hessada oothada ne giddofe iitaa digga.<verse eid="DEU 22:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 22:25"/>Issi asi asas giigida geela7iw asi bayna bessan wolqan oykidi, iyo iissiko, iya xalaali hayqo. <verse eid="DEU 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 22:26"/>Iya hayqos gathiya nagara oothaboonna gisho, na7e bolla aybaka oothopite. Hessi issi asi coo dendidi hara asi wodheysa mela. <verse eid="DEU 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 22:27"/>I iyo asi bayna bessan demmidi oykin, he geela7iya waassasu, shin iyo ashshiya asi bentibeenna.<verse eid="DEU 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 22:28"/>Issi asi oyshetaboonna geela7iw oykidi, I geela7otetha ekidi oyketeko, <verse eid="DEU 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 22:29"/>na7e aawa ishatamu bira santime<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:29 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Ishatamu bira santime: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Usupun xeetu giraame deexiya bira santime.</char></note> acco. Yaatidi na7iw baw macho ootho. Ba de7o laytha ubban iyo yeddofo.<verse eid="DEU 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 22:30"/>Issi asi ba aawa machiw ekidi, ba aawa kawushofo.<verse eid="DEU 22:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="DEU 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Shiiqope Diggiya Gaasota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 23:1"/>Sangatida woyko qaaratetida addey Godaa shiiquwa gelopo.<verse eid="DEU 23:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 23:2"/>Laymatethan yeletida asi Godaa shiiquwa gelopo. Hari attoshin tammantho yeletethi gakanaw, iya kochaafe oonika Godaa shiiquwa gelopo. <verse eid="DEU 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 23:3"/>Amoone asi gidin woyko Moo7abe asi gidin, Godaa asaa shiiquwa gelopo. Hari attoshin tammantho yeletethi gakanaw enta ase gidida oonika Godaa asaa shiiquwa gelopo. <verse eid="DEU 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 23:4"/>Neeni Gibxefe keyada bishin, enti katharanne haathara nena mokibookona. Enti Masephexoomen Patoora kataman de7iya Bi7oora na7aa Balaami nena baaddana mela shammidosona. <verse eid="DEU 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 23:5"/>Goday, ne Xoossay nena dosida gisho Balaama si7ibeenna; iya baadetha new anjon laammis. <verse eid="DEU 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 23:6"/>Ne de7o laytha ubban enti saro daana melanne duretana mela amottofa. <verse eid="DEU 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 23:7"/>Edoometi new dabbo gidiya gisho enta kadhopa; ne enta biittan bete asi gidada de7ida gisho Gibxeta kadhopa. <verse eid="DEU 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 23:8"/>Enta heedzantho yeletethay Godaa shiiquwa gelanaw danda7oosona.<verse eid="DEU 23:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Guta Tunatethafe Naago</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 23:9"/>Ne morketa olanaw keyada dunkaanida bessan nena tunatethafe naaga. <verse eid="DEU 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 23:10"/>Qamma amuhon atuntethay gukin, irxabay iya bolla de7iya oonika gutaape gaxa keyidi yan gam7o. <verse eid="DEU 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 23:11"/>Sa7i omarsiya wode ba asatethaa meecetidi, awi wulliya wode gutaa simmo.<verse eid="DEU 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 23:12"/>Ne wora sheeshi uttiya bessi gutaape karen giigisa. <verse eid="DEU 23:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 23:13"/>Sheeshas uttiya olla bookiya miishe ola miishera gathada oyka; sheeshas utta simmada ollan biitta zaara. <verse eid="DEU 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 23:14"/>Goday, ne Xoossay nena naaganawunne ne morketa ne kushen aathidi immanaw, ne gutan simeretees. I yan shaatiyaba be7idi, nena aggidi simmonna mela ne gutay geeshshi gidanaw koshshees.<verse eid="DEU 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dumma Dumma Higgeta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 23:15"/>Ba godaape baqatidi, neeko yida aylliya zaarada iya godaas immofa. <verse eid="DEU 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 23:16"/>I ne katamatape issuwan, ba koyida bessan ba koyida wode gakanaw de7o; iya un7ethofa.<verse eid="DEU 23:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 23:17"/>Isra7eele asaape oonika adde gidin woyko macca gidin, eeqa goyinniya asay ootheysada laymatopo. <verse eid="DEU 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 23:18"/>Adde gidin woyko maccas gidin, laymatethan demmida miishe qaangethi gathanaw Godaa ne Xoossaa keethi ehopo. Enta nam7aa Goday ne Xoossay ixees.<verse eid="DEU 23:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 23:19"/>Hinte koche gidida Isra7eele asaas miishe woyko kathi woyko haraba tal7ada yelo ekofa. <verse eid="DEU 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 23:20"/>Hara biitta asape yelo ekanaw danda7aasa; shin neeni laattanaw geliya biittan ne oothiyaba Goday, ne Xoossay anjana mela ne koche gidida Isra7eele asaas yelora tal7ofa.<verse eid="DEU 23:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 23:21"/>Godaas, ne Xoossaas, immanaw qangetidaba gathanaw gam7ofa. Goday ne Xoossay ne qangidaysa kumethi neepe koyiya gisho, polonna ixiko new nagara gidana. <verse eid="DEU 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 23:22"/>Shin ne qangonna aggiko hessi nagara gidenna. <verse eid="DEU 23:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 23:23"/>Godaas ne Xoossaas, immana gida ne doonan odetidaba neeni dosan immana gida gisho, ne inxarsan odetidaba pola.<verse eid="DEU 23:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 23:24"/>Neeni issi asa woyne gade giddora aadhiya wode woyniyape koyda mela ma, shin iyape aybaka ne oykida miishen yeggofa. <verse eid="DEU 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 23:25"/>Issi asa gadera neeni aadhiya wode he gadiyan de7iya tiyape duuthada ma; shin kathaafe cakada ne soo efopa.<verse eid="DEU 23:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="DEU 24"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 24:1"/>Issi asi macho eki simmidi, issi iitabaa I bolla demmidi iyo ixidi, pirimaa daakidi, yeddiko, <verse eid="DEU 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 24:2"/>iya soope keyada, hara azina geliko, <verse eid="DEU 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 24:3"/>he nam7antho azinay iyo dosonna ixidi, pirimaa daakidi, iyo ba soope kessidi yeddiko, woyko iyo ekida nam7antho azinay hayqiko, <verse eid="DEU 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 24:4"/>iya tunida gisho, koyro ekida azinay, zaaridi iyo ekofo. Hessi Godaa sinthan ixetidaba; ne Goday, ne Xoossay ne immiya biittan hessa mela nagara oothofa.<verse eid="DEU 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 24:5"/>Ooratha macho ekida asi olas boopo; hara deexo ooso oothofo. Issi laythi aadhana gakanaw awuka boonna ba machiw ufayso.<verse eid="DEU 24:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 24:6"/>Issi asa woxa woyko mayde acos oykofa; hessi keetha asay miyaba dhayidi hayqo guussu.<verse eid="DEU 24:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 24:7"/>Issi Isra7eele gidida ba ishaa kaysoti efidi, aylle kessey woyko haras bayziya uray hayqo. Hessada oothada iita uraa ne giddofe digga.<verse eid="DEU 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 24:8"/>Goga hargefe nena minthada naaga; Leewe koche gidida kahineti nena tamaarsiya ubbaa pola; ta entaw immida kiita naaga. <verse eid="DEU 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 24:9"/>Neeni Gibxefe keyada ogen de7ishin, Goday ne Xoossay Mayraami bolla oothidaysa akeeka.<verse eid="DEU 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 24:10"/>Issi asas issiba tal7ada, oythiyaba oychanaw iya soo gelopa. <verse eid="DEU 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 24:11"/>Neeni karen eqidashin, ne tal7ida uray oothiyaba soope kessidi new immo. <verse eid="DEU 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 24:12"/>I manqo gidiko, neeni acos oykida iya ma7uwa ne son aysopa. <verse eid="DEU 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 24:13"/>I ma7idi aqana mela sa7i omarsiya wode iyaw guye zaara; I nena galatana. Hessi Godaa ne Xoossaa sinthan new xillotetha ooso gididi taybetana.<verse eid="DEU 24:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 24:14"/>Manqonne maade koyidi dookaletida, Isra7eele gidida ne ishaa gidin woyko ne katamatape issuwan de7iya hara biitta asi naaqofa. <verse eid="DEU 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 24:15"/>I hachi oothidaysa hachi ekanaw minthidi koyiya gisho, awi wullonna iyaw qanxa. Hessi hanonna ixiko, manqoy Godaako waassin hessi new nagara gidana.<verse eid="DEU 24:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 24:16"/>Nayti oothida nagaraa gisho, aawata wodhanaw bessenna; qassi aawati oothida nagaraa gisho nayta wodhanaw bessenna. Oonika ba oothida nagaran nagaran hayqanaw bessees.<verse eid="DEU 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 24:17"/>Hara biitta asaa pirdaanne yi7o nayta pirdaa wobbisopa; am7e ma7uwa aco gisho oykofa. <verse eid="DEU 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 24:18"/>Neeni Gibxe biittan aylle gididaysanne Goday ne Xoossay nena yaape wozidi kessidaysa akeeka. Taani nena kiittey hessa gishosa.<verse eid="DEU 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 24:19"/>Neeni kathi cakiya wode ne dogida mirqiya ekanaw guye simmofa. Goday, ne Xoossay ne kushe ooso ubban nena anjana mela hessa bete asas, yi7o naytasinne am7etas aggaaga. <verse eid="DEU 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 24:20"/>Neeni shamaho ayfe maxiya wode wursada maxanaw nam7antho guye simmofa. Attidaysa bete asaas, yi7o naytasinne am7etas aggaaga. <verse eid="DEU 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 24:21"/>Neeni woyne ayfe maxiya wode wursada maxanaw nam7antho guye simmofa. Attidaysa bete asas, yi7o naytasinne am7etas aggaaga. <verse eid="DEU 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 24:22"/>Neeni Gibxe biittan aylle gidada de7idaysa dogopa. Taani nena kiittey hessa gishosa.<verse eid="DEU 24:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="DEU 25"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 25:1"/>Nam7u asati ooyetidi pirda keethi biiko, daynnati xilluwa ne like gidi, naaqidaysa ne bala gidi pirdo. <verse eid="DEU 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 25:2"/>Balidaysa garaafo bessiyaba gidiko, iya tirara zin7isidi zokon shocana mela daynnay kiitto. I garaafetey daynna sinthaninne I oothida balaa mela gido. <verse eid="DEU 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 25:3"/>I oytamu gakanaw garaafetanaw danda7ees, shin hessafe daropo. Hessafe dariko ne ishay ne sinthan kawuyana.<verse eid="DEU 25:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 25:4"/>Wudumman kathi yedhiya boora doona qachofa.<verse eid="DEU 25:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 25:5"/>Issife de7iya ishatape issoy na7a yelonna hayqiko, iya machiya hara asi gelopo. I azinaa ishay iyo ekidi, iw koshshiyaba kuntho. <verse eid="DEU 25:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 25:6"/>Hayqida ishaa sunthay Isra7eele asaa giddofe qushetidi dhayonna mela iya, koyro yeliya adde na7ay hayqida ishaa sunthan xeegeto.<verse eid="DEU 25:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 25:7"/>Gidoshin, I ba ishaa machiw ekanaw koyona ixiko, maccasiya katamaa pengen de7iya cimatako bada, “Ta azinaa ishay ba ishaa sunthay Isra7eelen daana mela koybeenna; tana ekidi, taw koshshiyaba kunthonna ixis” yaagada odo. <verse eid="DEU 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 25:8"/>Katamaa cimati iya xeegidi oychin, I ha77ika, “Taani iyo ekike” giiko, <verse eid="DEU 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 25:9"/>maccasiya cimata sinthan iyako shiiqada, iya caammaafe issuwa kessada, iya som7on cuttada, “Ba ishaas zerthi daana mela koyonna asa bolla haysa mela kawushi gakanaw bessees” yaago. <verse eid="DEU 25:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 25:10"/>Yaatin, he uraa soo asay Isra7eele kochaa giddon, “Caamma kessida asaa soo” geetetidi xeegetishe daana.<verse eid="DEU 25:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 25:11"/>Nam7u asati wadhetishin, issuwa machiya yada, ba azinaa shoceysa kushepe ashshanaw, ba kushiya yeddada hankuwa addetetha oykiko, <verse eid="DEU 25:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 25:12"/>I kushey qadhey bayna qanxeto.<verse eid="DEU 25:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 25:13"/>Gitanne guuthi gidida nam7u mizaane oykofa. <verse eid="DEU 25:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 25:14"/>Daronne guuthi makiya nam7u maka miishey new doopo. <verse eid="DEU 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 25:15"/>Goday, ne Xoossay new immiya biittan adussa laythi ne daana mela like mizaaneynne maka miishey new de7o. <verse eid="DEU 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 25:16"/>Goday ne Xoossay hessa melaba oothidi, balethiya oonaka ixees.<verse eid="DEU 25:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 25:17"/>Ne Gibxefe keyada oge bolla de7ishin, Amaaleqati ne bolla oothidaba akeeka. <verse eid="DEU 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 25:18"/>Enti Xoosse yayyonna dere; ne ogiyan enti neera eqetidosona. Ne bishin, daaburidi guye attida asa ubbaa wodhidosona. <verse eid="DEU 25:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 25:19"/>Hessa gisho, Goday ne Xoossay nena he biitta laatisidi, ne yuushuwan de7iya morketape nena shempisiya wode ha biittan enta hassayiya asi dhayana gakanaw Amaaleqata ubbaa dhaysa; hessa oothanaysa dogopa.<verse eid="DEU 25:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="DEU 26"/>
  <para style="s1">Bayra Katha Yarshonne Asraata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 26:1"/>Goday, ne Xoossay nena laatisiya biitta gelada, wopu gada duussi oykiya wode, <verse eid="DEU 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 26:2"/>Goday, ne Xoossay new immiya biittan mokida katha ubbaafe bayraa, Goday ne Xoossay ba sunthay xeegetana mela doorida bessaa ekada ba. <verse eid="DEU 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 26:3"/>He wode aawatiya kahiniyako bada, “Goday taw immana gidi kase nu mayzatas caaqida bessaa nuna gelsida Godaas, nu Xoossaas, hachi markatayis” yaagite. <verse eid="DEU 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 26:4"/>Kahiney kathaa ne kushepe ekidi, Godaa ne Xoossaa yarsho bessa sinthan wotho. <verse eid="DEU 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 26:5"/>Hessafe guye, Godaa ne Xoossaa sinthan haysada yaaga; “Ta mayzay bessafe besse yuuyishe de7ida Soore biitta asi; I taybon guutha asatara Gibxe wodhidi yan de7is. I yan de7ishe gita, wolqaamanne taybon daro dere gidis. <verse eid="DEU 26:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 26:6"/>Shin Gibxeti nuuni aylle gididi oothana mela un7ethidosona; kawushidosona. <verse eid="DEU 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 26:7"/>Yaatin, nuuni Godaako, nu aawata Xoossaako waassida. Goday nu waasuwa si7is; nu waayiya, nu daaburanne nu un7etetha be7is. <verse eid="DEU 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 26:8"/>Goday ba wolqaama kushiyan, ba micetida qesiyan, gita dagaman, malaataninne malaalsiyabatan nuna Gibxefe kessis. <verse eid="DEU 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 26:9"/>Ha bessaa nuna ehidi, maathinne eessi goggiya ha biitta nuus immis. <verse eid="DEU 26:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 26:10"/>Heko, Goday nuus immida biitta ayfiyape bayraa ehas” yaagada, kathaa Godaa ne Xoossaa sinthan wothada, iya sinthan gufanna. <verse eid="DEU 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 26:11"/>Newunne ne soo asaas Goday, ne Xoossay immida lo77oba ubban ufaytashe, Godaa galata. Leewetinne ne giddon de7iya bete asa ubbayka neera ufayto.<verse eid="DEU 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 26:12"/>Asraata kessiya heedzantho laythan, ne kathaafe asraata kessa ongidaape guye ne kataman de7iya Leewetas, bete asaas, yi7otasinne am7etas immada enti kallidi maana mela ootha. <verse eid="DEU 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 26:13"/>Godaa, ne Xoossaako, “Taani ta soope dummatida katha imota kessada, ne tana kiittidaysada Leewetas, bete asaas, yi7otasinne am7etas immas. Taani ne kiitaape issuwaka menthabike; issuwaka doga aggabike. <verse eid="DEU 26:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 26:14"/>Ta kayotiya wodeka, he asraatape aybaka mabike; ta tunida wodeka iya bochabike; hayqida asas iyape immabike. Taani Godaa, ta Xoossaa bonchas; I tana kiittidaba ubba polas. <verse eid="DEU 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 26:15"/>Ne de7iya geeshsha bessaafe, salope duge xeella; ne deriya Isra7eele anja; kase nu mayzatas ne immana gada caaqida maathinne eessi goggiya biitta nuus anja” yaaga.<verse eid="DEU 26:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossas Dummatida Dere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 26:16"/>Ne ha awaajotanne wogata naagana mela Goday ne Xoossay hachi nena kiittis. Hessa gisho, ne kumetha wozanapenne kumetha shempuwafe enta naaga. <verse eid="DEU 26:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 26:17"/>Goday, new Xoosse gideysanne neeni iya ogiyan baanaw, iya wogaa, iya kiitaanne higgiya naaganaysa hachi erisadasa. <verse eid="DEU 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 26:18"/>Goday ba gelida qaalada ne iya dere gideysa, iyaw buzo miishe gideysanne iya kiita ubbaa naageysata gideysa hachi nena erisis. <verse eid="DEU 26:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 26:19"/>Hessa ne oothiko, I medhida dere ubbaafe aathidi nena galatan, sunthaninne bonchon gita dere oothana. I gelida qaalada ne iyaw geeshsha dere gidana.<verse eid="DEU 26:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="DEU 27"/>
  <para style="s1">Ebaalan De7iya Yarsho Bessa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 27:1"/>Hessafe guye, Museynne Isra7eele cimati asaako, “Taani hachi hintena kiittiya kiitaa naagite. <verse eid="DEU 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 27:2"/>Yordaanose shaafa pinnada, Goday ne Xoossay new immiya biitta geliya wode gita shuchata essada noora tiya. <verse eid="DEU 27:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 27:3"/>Goday, ne aawata Xoossay new immana gidaysada maathinne eessi goggiya biitta, Goday ne Xoossay new immiya biitta ne pinniya wode ha higgeta ubbaa he shuchata bolla xaafa. <verse eid="DEU 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 27:4"/>Neeni Yordaanose pinnida wode ta nena hachi kiittidaysada ha shuchata Ebaala zuma bolla essada enta bolla noora tiya. <verse eid="DEU 27:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 27:5"/>He bessan Godaas, ne Xoossaas, birati bochonna shuchafe yarsho bessi giigisa. <verse eid="DEU 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 27:6"/>Godaas, ne Xoossaas yarsho bessi masetiboonna shuchafe ootha; iya bolla Godaas, ne Xoossaas xuussa yarsho yarsha. <verse eid="DEU 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 27:7"/>Issifetetha yarshuwa shiishada mashe Godaa, ne Xoossaa sinthan ufayta. <verse eid="DEU 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 27:8"/>Ha higgeta bentana mela oothada ha shuchata bolla qoncen xaafa” yaagis.<verse eid="DEU 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebaalape Wodhiya Baadethi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 27:9"/>Museynne Leewe gidida kahineti issife asaako, “Isra7eele, si77i gada wozanape si7a; hachi ne Godaa, ne Xoossaa dere gidadasa. <verse eid="DEU 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 27:10"/>Ta hachi new immiya Godaa, ne Xoossaa awaajota naaganne kiiteta” yaagis.<verse eid="DEU 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 27:11"/>He gallas Musey asaa haysada yaagidi kiittis. <verse eid="DEU 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 27:12"/>“Hinte Yordaanose pinnidaape guye Garzaana zuma bolla eqidi asaa anjanaysati, Simoona, Leewe, Yihuda, Yisakoora, Yoosefanne Biniyaame kochata. <verse eid="DEU 27:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 27:13"/>Qassi Ebaala zuma bolla eqidi asaa baaddanaysati, Robeela, Gaade, Aseera, Zabloona, Daanenne Niftaaleme kochata.<verse eid="DEU 27:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 27:14"/>“Leeweti banta qaala dhoqu oothidi, Isra7eele asaako haysada yaago.<verse eid="DEU 27:14"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 27:15"/>Godaa sinthan ixetidaba gidiya gisho, kushe hiillanchchoy mithi massidi, birata sheeshidi woyko shuchi qoxidi oothida eeqa geeman goyinniya oonika baadetidaysa gido” giiko,</para>
  <para style="pmr" vid="DEU 27:15">Asa ubbay, “Amin7i” yaago.<verse eid="DEU 27:15"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 27:16"/>“Ba aawa woyko ba aayiw kawushiya oonika baadetidaysa gido” giiko,</para>
  <para style="pmr" vid="DEU 27:16">Asa ubbay, “Amin7i” yaago.<verse eid="DEU 27:16"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 27:17"/>“Ba shooruwa zawa sugiya asi baadetidaysa gido” giiko,</para>
  <para style="pmr" vid="DEU 27:17">Asa ubbay, “Amin7i” yaago.<verse eid="DEU 27:17"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 27:18"/>“Qooqey baanaw bessiya ogiyape hara soo zaariya asi baadetidaysa gido” giiko,</para>
  <para style="pmr" vid="DEU 27:18">Asa ubbay, “Amin7i” yaago.<verse eid="DEU 27:18"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 27:19"/>“Bete asaa, yi7o naytanne am7eta pirda geellayiya asi baadetidaysa gido” yaagiko,</para>
  <para style="pmr" vid="DEU 27:19">Asa ubbay, “Amin7i” yaago.<verse eid="DEU 27:19"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 27:20"/>“Ba aawa machiw xaallidi, ba aawa bonchuwa qaariya asi baadetidaysa gido” giiko,</para>
  <para style="pmr" vid="DEU 27:20">Asa ubbay, “Amin7i” yaago.<verse eid="DEU 27:20"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 27:21"/>“Mehera tuniya asi baadetidaysa gido” giiko,</para>
  <para style="pmr" vid="DEU 27:21">Asa ubbay, “Amin7i” yaago.<verse eid="DEU 27:21"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 27:22"/>“Ba micho gidida aawa woyko aaye na7era tuniya asi baadetidaysa gido” giiko,</para>
  <para style="pmr" vid="DEU 27:22">Asa ubbay, “Amin7i” yaago.<verse eid="DEU 27:22"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 27:23"/>“Ba mache aayera tuniya asi baadetidaysa gido” giiko,</para>
  <para style="pmr" vid="DEU 27:23">Asa ubbay, “Amin7i” yaago.<verse eid="DEU 27:23"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 27:24"/>“Ase geeman wodhiya asi baadetidaysa gido” giiko,</para>
  <para style="pmr" vid="DEU 27:24">Asa ubbay, “Amin7i” yaago.<verse eid="DEU 27:24"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 27:25"/>“Miishen shametidi, xillo asi wodhiya asi baadetidaysa gido” giiko,</para>
  <para style="pmr" vid="DEU 27:25">Asa ubbay, “Amin7i” yaago.<verse eid="DEU 27:25"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 27:26"/>“Ha higgeta naagonna asi baadetidaysa gido” giiko,</para>
  <para style="pmr" vid="DEU 27:26">Asa ubbay, “Amin7i” yaago.<verse eid="DEU 27:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="DEU 28"/>
  <para style="s1">Kiitetethi Ehiya Anjo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 26:3-13">Leewe 26:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:12-24">Zaare 7:12-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 28:1"/>Neeni Godaa ne Xoossaas polo kiitetiko, hachi ta new immiya kiita ubbaa minthada naagiko, Goday, ne Xoossay biittan de7iya kawotethata ubbaafe aathidi nena dhoqu dhoqu oothana. <verse eid="DEU 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 28:2"/>Neeni Godaa, ne Xoossaas kiitetiko, haysafe kaallidi de7iya anjo ubbay nebaa gidana.<verse eid="DEU 28:2"/></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 28:3"/>Ne katamaninne ne goshshan anjetidaysa gidana.<verse eid="DEU 28:3"/></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 28:4"/>Ne ulo ayfey, ne kathay, ne mehey, ne dorsatinne ne deeshati anjetidaysata gidana.<verse eid="DEU 28:4"/></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 28:5"/>Ne keesheynne ne munaqa miishey anjetidaysa gidana.<verse eid="DEU 28:5"/></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 28:6"/>Ne kessaynne ne geloy anjetidaysa gidana.<verse eid="DEU 28:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 28:7"/>Ne bolla dendiya ne morketa, Goday ne sinthan xoonetidaysata oothana. Enti ne bolla issi ogera yaana, shin laapun ogera ne sinthafe baqatana.<verse eid="DEU 28:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 28:8"/>Goday ne kushey oykiyabaanne ne shaaliya anjana; Goday, ne Xoossay new immiya biittan nena anjana.<verse eid="DEU 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 28:9"/>Neeni Godaa, ne Xoossaa kiita naagikonne iya ogiyan biiko, I new caaqidaysada Goday nena baw geeshsha dere oothidi essana. <verse eid="DEU 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 28:10"/>Hessafe guye, biittan de7iya asa ubbay Goday ba sunthan nena xeegidaysa be7idi yayyana. <verse eid="DEU 28:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 28:11"/>Goday new immanaw ne mayzatas caaqida he biittan, ne ulo ayfiya, ne mehiya, ne goshsha ayfiya darsidi anjana. <verse eid="DEU 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 28:12"/>Ne kushe ooso ubbaa anjanawunne, Goday ne biittas ira woden woden bukisanaw ba minja keethaa, salo pengiya new dooyana. Neeni daro kawotethatas gede tal7anaape attishin, oodefeka haa tal7aka. <verse eid="DEU 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 28:13"/>Goday nena ubbaas kace kessanaape attishin, goyna kessenna. Hachi ta new immiya, Godaa, ne Xoossaa kiita si7ada, minthada naagiko, ne bolla gidanaape attishin, garse gidaka. <verse eid="DEU 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 28:14"/>Ta new hachi immida kiitaape haddirsi woyko ushachi gada, hara xoossata kaallofa; enta goyinnofa.<verse eid="DEU 28:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiitetonna Ixoy Ehiya Baadethi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 26:14-46">Leewe 26:14-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 28:15"/>Shin neeni Godaa, ne Xoossaas kiitetonna ixada, hachi ta nena kiittiya wogaanne higgiya ubbaa naagonna ixiko, haysafe kaallidi de7iya baadethati ubbay ne bolla yaananne nena demmana.<verse eid="DEU 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 28:16"/>Ne katamaninne ne goshshan baadetidaysa gidana.<verse eid="DEU 28:16"/></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 28:17"/>Ne keesheynne munaqa miishey baadetidaysa gidana.<verse eid="DEU 28:17"/></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 28:18"/>Ne ulo ayfey, ne katha ayfey, ne mehey, ne dorsaynne deeshay baadetidaysa gidana.<verse eid="DEU 28:18"/></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 28:19"/>Ne kessaynne ne geloy baadetidaysa gidana.<verse eid="DEU 28:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 28:20"/>Neeni iita ooso oothada tana aggida gisho, neeni eeson dhayana gakanaw ne oothiya ooso ubban Goday baadethi, dagamanne kawushatethi yeddana. <verse eid="DEU 28:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 28:21"/>Neeni laattanaw biya biittafe dhayana gakanaw Goday, gadoy neepe duuxonna mela oothana. <verse eid="DEU 28:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 28:22"/>Goday nena gilqatethan, mishan, madunthan, xuuggiya awan, koshan, wol7oninne kathi dhaysiya harmen ne dhayana gakanaw shocana. <verse eid="DEU 28:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 28:23"/>Neepe bollara de7iya saloy naase birata gidana; neepe garsara de7iya biittay birata gidana. <verse eid="DEU 28:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 28:24"/>Goday ne biittan bukiya ira bidonne baana kessana; neeni dhayana gakanaw salope baani bukana.<verse eid="DEU 28:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 28:25"/>Goday nena ne morketan xoonisana. Neeni enta olanaw issi ogera keyana; shin laapun ogera ne enta sinthafe baqatana. Biittan de7iya kawotethi ubbay ne bolla gakidaba be7idi, yashshan kokorana. <verse eid="DEU 28:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 28:26"/>Ne ahay salo kafotasinne bazzo do7atas kathi gidana; enta yedethiya oonika deenna.<verse eid="DEU 28:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 28:27"/>Goday nena paxoy bayna Gibxe gadon, kixan, madunthaninne puuso hergen shocana. <verse eid="DEU 28:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 28:28"/>Goday nena gooshshatethan, qooqetethaninne dagaman shocana. <verse eid="DEU 28:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 28:29"/>Seeta gallas neeni qooqey tattafeysada tattafana; ne oothiyaba ubbay new giigonna ixana. Ne de7o laytha ubban ne un7etananne bonqetada daana. Nena maaddiya asi demmaka.<verse eid="DEU 28:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 28:30"/>Ne macho oycha giigisana, shin iyo hari dafi ekidi iissana. Neeni keethe keexana, shin iyan de7aka. Woyne tokana, shin iya ayfiya maaka. <verse eid="DEU 28:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 28:31"/>Ne booray ne sinthan shuketana, shin iya ashuwa maaka. Ne harey neepe wolqan eketana, shin new guye simmenna. Ne dorsati ne morketas imetana, enta ashshanaw nena maaddiya asi deenna. <verse eid="DEU 28:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 28:32"/>Ne ayfey be7ishin ne adde naytinne macca nayti hara kawotethas imetana. Enti simmin be7ana gada xeellishin, ne ayfey tollu gidi attana; hessa digganaw new wolqi deenna. <verse eid="DEU 28:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 28:33"/>Ne biitta ayfiyanne ne cawa ubbaa ne eronna asi maana; ne de7o laytha ubban un7etidaysanne naaqetidaysa gidana. <verse eid="DEU 28:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 28:34"/>Ne be7iya iitati nena gooshshana. <verse eid="DEU 28:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 28:35"/>Goday paxoy bayna iita madunthan ne gulbatanne ne wodiriya hargisana; tohope huuphe gakanaw, nena he madunthan shocana.<verse eid="DEU 28:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 28:36"/>Goday nenanne ne kawa, nenanne ne mayzata eronna asa biitta efana. Hessan neeni mithafenne shuchafe oosetida hara xoossata goyinnana. <verse eid="DEU 28:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 28:37"/>Goday nena laaliya hara kawotethata giddon neeni miichasinne kaassas attana.<verse eid="DEU 28:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 28:38"/>Neeni daro kathi ne goshshan zerana; shin booley midigin, guutha kathi shiishana. <verse eid="DEU 28:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 28:39"/>Woyne tokada iya harmana, shin guxuney iya midigin, iyape ayfe demmaka woyko iyape uyaka. <verse eid="DEU 28:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 28:40"/>Ne biitta ubban shamahoy dolana, shin ayfey qoqofetidi wuriya gisho, shamaho zayte demmaka. <verse eid="DEU 28:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 28:41"/>Ne addenne macca yelana, shin oli di77idi efiya gisho enti neera dookona. <verse eid="DEU 28:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 28:42"/>Ne mithaanne ne biitta ayfiya booley wursana.<verse eid="DEU 28:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 28:43"/>Ne giddon de7iya bete asay ne bolla dhoqu dhoqu gaana, shin ne guye attada ziqi ziqi gaana. <verse eid="DEU 28:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 28:44"/>I new tal7anaape attishin, ne iyaw tal7aka; I huuphe gidana; neeni goyna gidana.<verse eid="DEU 28:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 28:45"/>Godaa, ne Xoossaa, ne kiitetonna ixida gishonne iya wogaanne higgiya naagonna ixida gisho, ne dhayana gakanaw ha baadethati ubbay ne bolla wodhana; nena enti yedethana. <verse eid="DEU 28:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 28:46"/>Ha baadethati ne bollanne ne kochaa bolla merinaw malaatanne malaalsiyaba gidana. <verse eid="DEU 28:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 28:47"/>New sa7i injetida wode Godaa, ne Xoossaa ufaysaninne galatan goyinnona gisho, <verse eid="DEU 28:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 28:48"/>nena koshan, saamon, kallotethaninne meton ubbaba dhayada, Goday ne bolla yeddiya ne morketas haaretana. Goday nena dhaysana gakanaw ne morgen birata qambara wothana.<verse eid="DEU 28:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 28:49"/>Goday ne enta qaala eronna kawotethata, biitta gaxape ankoy piradhidi wodheysada ne bolla ehana. <verse eid="DEU 28:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 28:50"/>Enti wozana minota; cima bonchonayisata; naytas qadhetonayisata. <verse eid="DEU 28:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 28:51"/>Ne dhayana gakanaw enti ne mehiyanne goshsha ayfiya maana. Neeni dhayana gakanaw ne kathaa, ne woyniya, ne zaytiya, ne miizanne ne dorsa wudiya maarokona. <verse eid="DEU 28:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 28:52"/>Goday, ne Xoossay new immiya biittan de7iya ne ammanetiya adussenne mino dirsati laaletana gakanaw ne katamaa yuushuwa teqidi nena un7ethana.<verse eid="DEU 28:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="DEU 28:53"/>Ne morketi katamaa teqidi nena un7ethiya wode miyaba dhayada, Goday ne Xoossay new immida ne ulo ayfe gidida ne adde naytanne ne macca nayta maana. <verse eid="DEU 28:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="DEU 28:54"/>Ne giddon hari attoshin kase injen de7ida asika ba ishaas, ba dosiya machesinne ba yelida naytas ba kathaafe shaakenna. <verse eid="DEU 28:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="DEU 28:55"/>Morketi katamaa teqidi un7ethiya wode maanabay hari bayna gisho, miya ba nayta ashuwape hara oodeska immenna. <verse eid="DEU 28:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="DEU 28:56"/>Ne giddon kase injen de7ida, ba injiyafe dendoysan sa7a yedhanaw shaatetiya maccasiya, ba dosiya azinaasinne ba yelida naytas uuzettana. <verse eid="DEU 28:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="DEU 28:57"/>Morketi iya de7iya katamaa teqidi iyo un7ethida gishonne waaysida gisho, iw hari miyabay dhayin, ba yelida na7aanne do7aa enta gathonna geeman barka maana.<verse eid="DEU 28:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="DEU 28:58"/>Ha maxaafan xaafetida higgeta ne naagonna ixiko, malaalsiyanne yashshiya Godaa, ne Xoossaa suntha bonchona ixiko, <verse eid="DEU 28:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="DEU 28:59"/>ne bollanne ne kochaa bolla Goday, yashshiya gado, daro wode gam7iya, paxoy bayna iita harge yeddana.<verse eid="DEU 28:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="DEU 28:60"/>Kase Gibxe asaa bolla be7ada, ne yayyida Gibxe harge ubbaa zaaridi ne bolla ehana; he hargey nena yeddenna. <verse eid="DEU 28:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="DEU 28:61"/>Gujidika, ha higge maxaafan xaafetiboonna hargetanne gadota ubbaa ne dhayana gakanaw Goday ne bolla ehana. <verse eid="DEU 28:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="DEU 28:62"/>Godaa, hinte Xoossa hinte si7onna ixida gisho, salo xoolintoda darida hintefe guuthi attana. <verse eid="DEU 28:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="DEU 28:63"/>Goday, hintew lo77oba oothiya wodenne hinte tayboy dariya wode ufaytidaysada ha77i hinte bolla gado ehiya wodenne hintena dhaysiya wode ufaytana; hinte laattanaw biya biittafe shodetidi dhayana.<verse eid="DEU 28:63"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="DEU 28:64"/>Goday nena ha gaxape ya gaxa gakanaw kawotethata ubbaa giddon laallana. Yan neeni woyko ne mayzati eronna hara mithinne shucha xoossata goyinnana. <verse eid="DEU 28:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="DEU 28:65"/>He kawotethata giddon hinte shempo demmeketa; tohoy yedhiya bessika new deenna. Yan Goday new qofan kumida guugge, amon argaacida ayfenne ufaysi qanxida wozana immana. <verse eid="DEU 28:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="DEU 28:66"/>Ne de7oy hirgan kumana; gallasinne qamma dagamaninne hayqo yashshan un7etada daana. <verse eid="DEU 28:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="DEU 28:67"/>Ne wozanan kumida yashshaafenne ne ayfey be7iya palabaape dendoysan, wontiya wode neeni, “Awude qammandeesha” qassi qammiya wode, “Awude wontandesha” yaagana. <verse eid="DEU 28:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="DEU 28:68"/>Ta nena, “Zaarada ha ogiyara baaka” gida ogiyara Goday nena zaaridi markaben guye Gibxe yeddana. Yan neeni aylle gidanaw ne morketas nena bayzanaw koyana, shin hintena aylleyanaw shammiya asi demmeketa.<verse eid="DEU 28:68"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="DEU 29"/>
  <para style="s1">Moo7aben Zaari immida Caaquwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 29:1"/>Goday Koreeba zuman, Isra7eele asaara caaqida caaquwa bolla gujidi Moo7aben entara caaqanaw Muse kiitida caaqo qaalati haysata. <verse eid="DEU 29:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 29:2"/>Musey Isra7eele asaa ubbaa xeegi shiishidi, haysada yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 29:2">Goday Gibxe kawa bolla, iya olanchota bollanne iya biitta ubbaa bolla oothidabaanne gathidaba hinte, hinte ayfen be7ideta. <verse eid="DEU 29:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 29:3"/>Enta bolla gathida iita metota, malaalsiyabatanne gita malaatata hinte, hinte ayfen be7ideta. <verse eid="DEU 29:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 29:4"/>Shin hachi gakanaw Goday, hintew akeekiya wozana, xeelliya ayfenne si7iya haythi immibeenna. <verse eid="DEU 29:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 29:5"/>Goday oytamu laythi kumethi hintena mela biittan kaalethiya wode hinte ma7oy wuribeenna, hinte caammay cimibeenna. <verse eid="DEU 29:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 29:6"/>Goday, hinte Xoossaa gideysa hinte erana mela uythi mibeeketa; woyne woyko hara mathoyiya ushshi uyibeeketa.<verse eid="DEU 29:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 29:7"/>Nuuni ha bessa gakida wode Haseboona Kawoy Sihooninne Baasane Kawoy Oogey nuura oletanaw keyidosona, shin nuuni enta xoonida. <verse eid="DEU 29:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 29:8"/>Enta biitta ekidi, Robeelanne Gaade kochaas, qassi Minaase kochaafe baggaas laata oothidi immida.<verse eid="DEU 29:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 29:9"/>Hinte oykiyabaynne yedhiyabay hintew anjetana mela ha caaqo qaalata ammanetidi naagite. <verse eid="DEU 29:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 29:10"/>Hachi hinte ubbay, kochata halaqati, cimati, shuumatinne Isra7eele asa ubbay haysan Godaa sinthan eqideta. <verse eid="DEU 29:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 29:11"/>Hinte naytara, hinte machetara, hinte giddon de7idi, mithi mixiyanne haathe tikiya hara biitta asaara issife haysan eqideta. <verse eid="DEU 29:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 29:12"/>Godaa, hinte Xoossara qaala gelanaw haysan eqideta. Goday ha qaala hachi hintera caaqon minthana. <verse eid="DEU 29:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 29:13"/>Goday hintena ba ase oothidi minthana; hintewunne hinte mayzatas, Abrahaames, Yisaaqasinne Yayqoobas caaqidaysada I hintew Xoosse gidana. <verse eid="DEU 29:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 29:14"/>Goday ha caaqo qaala essey hinte xalaalara gidenna. <verse eid="DEU 29:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 29:15"/>Hachi haysan, Godaa, nu Xoossaa sinthan eqida nu ubbaaranne sinthafe yaana yeleta ubbaara essees.<verse eid="DEU 29:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 29:16"/>Nuuni Gibxen waanidi de7idaakonne ha77i gakanaw ogen de7iya kawotethata giddora waanidi kanthidi yidaako ereeta. <verse eid="DEU 29:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 29:17"/>Enta giddon de7iya ixetida mitha, shucha, biranne worqa eeqa misileta be7ideta. <verse eid="DEU 29:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 29:18"/>Ha hintefe oonika adde gidin macca gidin, issi soo asi gidin, issi kochi gidin Godaa, nu Xoossaafe, haakidi hara kawotethata xoossata goyinnona mela naagetite. Hessa mela cammiyanne wodhiya ayfe ayfiya asi hinte giddon de7opo.<verse eid="DEU 29:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 29:19"/>Ha caaqo qaala si7idi, ba wozanan, “Ta shenen taani biikoka, metoy baawa” yaagidi bana cimmiko, hessa mela asi lo77ota bollanne iitata bolla dhayo ehees. <verse eid="DEU 29:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 29:20"/>Godaa hanqoynne qanaatey hessa mela ase bolla eexidi keyana. Ha maxaafan xaafetida baadethi ubbay iya bolla yaana; salope garsan iya suntha Goday quchana. <verse eid="DEU 29:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 29:21"/>Goday ha higge maxaafan xaafetida baadetha caaqo qaalada he uraa Isra7eele giddofe shaakidi dhaysana.<verse eid="DEU 29:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 29:22"/>Yaana yeletethay, hinte sheeshaynne haaho biittafe yaa hara biitta asay, Goday hinte bolla ehida gaduwanne hargiya be7ana. <verse eid="DEU 29:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 29:23"/>Biitta ubbay diinneninne maxinen kumana; toketiyabay deenna; doliyabay bentenna; maatinne mithi dolenna. Goday ba hanqon dhaysida Soodomadanne Gamoorada, Adaamadanne Xaboyma katamatada hanana. <verse eid="DEU 29:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 29:24"/>Kawotethati, “Goday ha biitta bolla haysa melaba ayis oothidee? Ha wolqaama hanquwas gaasoy aybee?” yaagana.<verse eid="DEU 29:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 29:25"/>Asay zaaridi, “Enti Goday, enta aawata Xoossay, enta Gibxefe kessida wode entara gelida caaqo qaala menthida gishosa. <verse eid="DEU 29:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 29:26"/>Enti eronna xoossatasinne I goyinnofite gida xoossata goyinnidosona. <verse eid="DEU 29:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 29:27"/>Hessa gisho, Goday hanqetidi, ha maxaafan xaafetida baadethata ubbaa enta bolla ehis. <verse eid="DEU 29:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 29:28"/>Goday wolqaama hanqo hanqetidi, enta biittafe entana shoddidi hara biitta yedethis” yaagana.<verse eid="DEU 29:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 29:29"/>Xuuray nu Godaa nu Xoossasa, shin nuuni ha higge qaala oothana mela qoncidaysati merinaw nuusanne nu naytasa.<verse eid="DEU 29:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="DEU 30"/>
  <para style="s1">Xoossako Simon Bentiya Anjo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 30:1"/>Hachi ta ne sinthan wothida anjoynne baadethay ne bolla gakiya wode Goday, ne Xoossay nena laaliya hara kawotethata giddon de7ishe haysa ne akeekiko, <verse eid="DEU 30:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 30:2"/>nenne ne nayti Godaa, ne Xoossaako, simmada, ne kumetha wozanapenne ne kumetha shempuwafe taani hachi nena kiittiya higgiyas kiitetiko, <verse eid="DEU 30:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 30:3"/>yan Goday, ne Xoossay ne di7etida biittafe nena zaarana. I hintew qadhetidi hintena laallida kawotethata ubbaa giddofe zaaridi shiishana. <verse eid="DEU 30:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 30:4"/>Biitta gaxape gaxa gakanaw ne laaletikoka, yaape Goday, ne Xoossay nena zaaridi shiishana. <verse eid="DEU 30:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 30:5"/>Ne aawati kase laattida biitta, neka laattana mela Goday, ne Xoossay nena he biitta ehana. Yan nena ne aawatape aathidi dureyana; ne taybuwa darsana.<verse eid="DEU 30:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 30:6"/>Ne de7on daana melanne Godaa, ne Xoossaa ne kumetha wozanapenne ne kumetha shempuwafe dosana mela I newunne ne naytas kiitetiya wozana immana. <verse eid="DEU 30:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 30:7"/>Goday, ne Xoossay ha baadethata ubbaa ne morketanne nena gooddeyisata bolla ehana. <verse eid="DEU 30:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 30:8"/>Hachi ta nena kiittiya higgiya ne naagana; zaarada Godaas, ne Xoossaas kiitetana. <verse eid="DEU 30:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 30:9"/>He wode Goday ne Xoossay nena ne kushe ooso ubban, ne ulo ayfiyan, mehiyaninne ne goshsha ayfiyan nena darsidi anjana. Goday kase ne aawata anjidi ufaytidaysada nena anjidi ufaytana. <verse eid="DEU 30:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 30:10"/>Hessi hananay ha higge maxaafan xaafetida Godaa, ne Xoossaa higgiyanne wogaa naagada, Godaa, ne Xoossaako ne kumetha wozanapenne ne kumetha shempuwafe simmiko.<verse eid="DEU 30:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 30:11"/>Hachi ta nena kiittiya kiitati hessa mela deexo gidokona; neepe haakokona. <verse eid="DEU 30:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 30:12"/>Neeni, “Nuuni si7idi kiitetana mela salo keyidi nuus wodhisanay oonee?” goonna mela salona gidenna. <verse eid="DEU 30:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 30:13"/>“Nuuni si7idi kiitetana mela nuus abba pinnidi ehanay oonee?” goonna mela abbaafe hefinthana gidenna. <verse eid="DEU 30:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 30:14"/>Qaalay new daro matan de7ees; ne oothana mela qaalay ne wozanaaninne ne doonan de7ees.<verse eid="DEU 30:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 30:15"/>Heko, ta hachi ne sinthan de7onne lo77otethi, hayqonne dhayo wothas. <verse eid="DEU 30:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 30:16"/>Ne Godaa, ne Xoossaa dosiko, iya ogiyan biiko, iya kiitaa, iya awaajuwanne iya higgiya naagiko, ne de7on daananne darana. Ne laattanaw geliya biittan Goday, ne Xoossay nena anjana.<verse eid="DEU 30:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 30:17"/>Shin ne wozanay Godaape haakin, iyaw kiitetonna ixada, hara xoossatas gufannada enta goyinniko, <verse eid="DEU 30:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 30:18"/>hinte ubbay dhayanaysa ta hachi hintew odayis. Yordaanose pinnidi hinte laattanaw biya biittan hinte laythay aduqenna.<verse eid="DEU 30:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 30:19"/>Ta hinte sinthan de7onne hayqo, anjonne baadethi wothidaysas hachi salonne sa7a hinte bolla markayana. Hiza hintenne hinte sheeshay de7on daana mela de7o doorite. <verse eid="DEU 30:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 30:20"/>Godaa ne Xoossaa dosa; iya qaala si7a, iyaw kiiteta; iyara oyketa. Hessada haniko, Goday kase ne mayzatas, Abrahaames, Yisaaqasinne Yayqoobas immanaw caaqida biittan nenne ne sheeshay adussa laythi daana.<verse eid="DEU 30:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="DEU 31"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyyasuy Muse Bessan Sunthetis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 31:1"/>Musey ba odaa wursidaape guye Isra7eele asaako haysada yaagis; <verse eid="DEU 31:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 31:2"/>“Ha77i taw xeetanne laatamu laythi gidida gisho, hizape guye kaalethanaw danda7ike. Goday taako, ‘Ne Yordaanose pinnaka’ yaagis. <verse eid="DEU 31:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 31:3"/>Goday, ne Xoossay ne sinthe aadhidi nena kaalethana. Yan de7iya kawotethata I dhaysana gisho, enta biitta ne laattana. Goday gidaysada Iyyasuy hintena kaalethana. <verse eid="DEU 31:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 31:4"/>Goday Amoore kawota Sihoonanne Ooge xoonidi, enta biitta dhaysidaysada hinte morketa hessada oothana. <verse eid="DEU 31:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 31:5"/>Goday enta hintew aathidi immin, hinte enta bolla ta hintena kiittidaysada oothana. <verse eid="DEU 31:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 31:6"/>Minnite; gencite; yayyofite. Enta be7idi dagammopite. Goday hinte Xoossay hintera gidana; I hintena yeggenna, aggenna” yaagis.<verse eid="DEU 31:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 31:7"/>Musey Iyyasu xeegidi, Isra7eele asaa ubbaa sinthan haysada yaagis; “Minna; genca. Ne ha asaara issife Goday enta mayzatas immana gidi caaqida biitta gelaasa; he biitta enta laatisaasa. <verse eid="DEU 31:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 31:8"/>Goday, I ba huuphen neera gididi nena kaalethana. I nena yeggenna; aggenna. Hessa gisho, yayyofa; ufaysi qanxofa” yaagis.<verse eid="DEU 31:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Higgey Qoncen Nabbabeto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 31:9"/>Musey ha higgiya xaafidi, Godaa qaala caaqo Taabotiya tookiya kahine gidida Leewe naytasinne Isra7eele cimatas immis. <verse eid="DEU 31:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 31:10"/>Musey entako, “Aco ubbay atto geetetiya laapuntha laytha wursethan, Shaqara Ba7aaley bonchetiya gallas, ha higgiya dhoqu oothidi nabbabite. <verse eid="DEU 31:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 31:11"/>Godaa, hinte Xoossaa sinthan, I doorida bessan, iya goyinnanaw Isra7eele asa ubbay shiiqiya wode entaw nabbabite. <verse eid="DEU 31:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 31:12"/>Enti ubbay si7idi, Godaa, hinte Xoossaas yashshi tamaarana mela ha higge qaala ubbaa naagana mela addeta, maccasata, naytanne hinte biittan de7iya hara biitta asaa issife shiishite. <verse eid="DEU 31:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 31:13"/>Ha higge qaala eronna enta naytika Yordaanose pinnidi, hinte laattanaw biya biittan, hinte de7iya laytha ubban ha higgiya si7o; Godaas, hinte Xoossaas, yashshi tamaaro” yaagidi kiittis.<verse eid="DEU 31:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Isra7eele Geellatethay Koyrottidi Odetis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 31:14"/>Goday Museko, “Ne hayqiya wodey matis. I kaalethana wogaa ta iyaw immana mela Iyyasu xeegada, iyara issife Dunkaaniya penge shiiqite” yaagin, Museynne Iyyasuy Dunkaaniya pengiyako shiiqidosona.<verse eid="DEU 31:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 31:15"/>Goday Dunkaaniya pengen eqida shaara tuussan entaw qoncis.<verse eid="DEU 31:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 31:16"/>Goday Museko, “Neeni mata wode hayqada ne aawatan gahetaasa. Neepe guye, ha asay taw ammanetonayisata gidana; ta entara gelida caaquwa menthana. Enti tana aggidi, banta laattiya biittan de7iya eeqata kaallana. <verse eid="DEU 31:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 31:17"/>Hessi haniya wode ta hanqoy enta bolla eexana; ta enta aggaagana; ta som7uwa entafe hara soo zaarana. Enti dhayana; iita metoynne dhayoy enta bolla yaana. He wode enti, ‘Tuma ha metoy nuna gakiday nu Xoossay nu giddon bayna gisho gidennee?’ yaagana. <verse eid="DEU 31:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 31:18"/>Hara xoossata goyinnidi, enti oothida iita oosuwa gisho, ta he gallas ta som7uwa entafe hara soo zaarana.<verse eid="DEU 31:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 31:19"/>“Ha77i ha mazmuriya xaafada, Isra7eele asaa ubbaa tamaarsa. Ha mazmurey taw Isra7eele asaa bolla marka gidana mela enta yexisa. <verse eid="DEU 31:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 31:20"/>Enta mayzatas gelida qaalada, maathinne eessi goggiya biitta ta enta gelsa simmin, enti mi kallidi goobidaape guye, hara xoossata goyinnidi, tana kadhana; ta caaquwa menthana. <verse eid="DEU 31:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 31:21"/>Daro metoynne dhayoy enta bolla gakida wode ha mazmurey enta naytape baletonna gisho, enta bolla marka gidana. Taani caaqida biitta enta buroo gelsonna de7ishin, haara enti qopiya qofaa taani erayis” yaagis. <verse eid="DEU 31:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 31:22"/>Musey he gallas mazmuriya xaafidi, Isra7eele asaa tamaarsis.<verse eid="DEU 31:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 31:23"/>Hessafe guye, Goday Nawe na7aa Iyyasuko, “Minna, genca; ta entaw immanaw qaala gelida biitta Isra7eele asaa efada gelsa. Ta neera gidana” yaagis.<verse eid="DEU 31:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 31:24"/>Musey ha higgeta koyrope wursethi gakanaw xaafidi wursidaape guye, <verse eid="DEU 31:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 31:25"/>Godaa, Qaala caaqo Taabotiya tookiya Leeweta haysada yaagidi kiittis; <verse eid="DEU 31:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 31:26"/>“Godaa higgey xaafetida ha maxaafa efidi, Godaa, hinte Xoossaa Qaala caaqo Taabotiya matan wothite. Yan I hinte bolla marka gidana. <verse eid="DEU 31:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 31:27"/>Hinte ay mela geellekonne wozana iiteko ta erayis. Tuma, ta hintera de7ida laytha ubban hinte Godaas makallata, shin ta hayqin, ubba hintte waanidi makallandetii? <verse eid="DEU 31:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 31:28"/>Hessa gisho, haysa ubbaa ta entaw odanawunne salonne sa7a ta enta bolla markayanaw hinte kochaa halaqatanne deriya kaalethiya asaa ubbaa taw shiishite. <verse eid="DEU 31:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 31:29"/>Ta hayqidaape guye, hinte tuma iita ase gidanaysanne taani hintena tamaarsida kiitaape hara soo simmanaysa taani erayis. Hinte iya sinthan iitabaa oothidi, Godaa yiloyiya gisho, wodepe I hinte bolla iita gado ehana” yaagis.<verse eid="DEU 31:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Muse Mazmuriya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 31:30"/>Hessafe guye, Musey ha mazmure qaalata wurana gakanaw shiiqida Isra7eele maabara ubbaa nabbabidi sissis.<verse eid="DEU 31:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 31"/>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="DEU 32"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 32:1"/>Saloto, taani odeysa si7ite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:1">biittay ta doona qaala hayzo.<verse eid="DEU 32:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 32:2"/>Ta timirtey ira mela buko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:2">ta qaalay akada wodho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:2">Maata bolla wodhiya xaasada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:2">dola bolla wodhiya puuseda wodho.<verse eid="DEU 32:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 32:3"/>Taani Godaa sunthaa awaajana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:3">gitatetha nu Xoossaas immite.<verse eid="DEU 32:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 32:4"/>I nu Zaalla; iya oosoy polo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:4">iya ogey suure.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:4">Xoossay ammantheysa; wordoy baynaysa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:4">I tumanchonne suure.<verse eid="DEU 32:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 32:5"/>Iya sinthan banta tunatethaa bessidosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:5">enti iya na7a gidokona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:5">enti iitanne geella yeletethi.<verse eid="DEU 32:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 32:6"/>Hinteno, eeyanne akeeki bayna asaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:6">hinte Godaas immiya zaaroy haysee?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:6">I hintena medhida hinte Aawa gidennee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:6">hintena medhidi minthi essiday iya gidennee?<verse eid="DEU 32:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 32:7"/>Beni wodiya qopa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:7">aadhida yeletethaa akeeka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:7">Ne aawa oycha; I new odana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:7">cimata oycha; enti new qoncisana.<verse eid="DEU 32:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 32:8"/>Ubbaafe Wolqaamay kawotethatas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:8">enta laata shaakida wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:8">asa zerethika dummayida wode,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:8">Isra7eele asaa taybuwa mela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:8">asaas enta zawa essis.<verse eid="DEU 32:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 32:9"/>Godaa gakida gishoy Isra7eele;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:9">Yayqoobi iya gakida laata.<verse eid="DEU 32:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 32:10"/>I enta mela biittan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:10">aykoy bayna mela biittan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:10">carkoy baqishin demmis.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:10">Iyaw gondalle gidis, iya naagis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:10">ba ayfe na77eda minthidi naagis.<verse eid="DEU 32:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 32:11"/>Arganthi ba na7a paalo tamaarseysada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:11">ba miccida qefiyan gakidi ashsheysada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:11">Goday ba qefiyan haphidi enta ashshis.<verse eid="DEU 32:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 32:12"/>Goday ba xalaala enta kaalethis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:12">hara allaga xoossi iyara baawa.<verse eid="DEU 32:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 32:13"/>I biittas dhoqa bessaa enta kessis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:13">goshsha ayfiya enta muzis.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:13">Zaalla qophope enta eessi kalsis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:13">shucha biittafe bentiya zayte ushshis.<verse eid="DEU 32:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 32:14"/>Enta mehiyape qeesa maathi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:14">dorsafenne deeshape xamaata maathi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:14">modho dorsenne deesha asho midosona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:14">Baasane dorsaanne deesha ashuwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:14">lo77o giste uythara midosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:14">suuthi daaniya woyne ushsha uyidosona.<verse eid="DEU 32:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 32:15"/>Shin Isra7eeley ordis; makallis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:15">midi kallidi moollotis.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:15">Bana medhida Xoossaa aggis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:15">ba Atotethaa Zaalla kawushis.<verse eid="DEU 32:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 32:16"/>Enti allaga xoossata goyinnidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:16">iya qanaatisidosona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:16">Ixetida banta eeqatan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:16">iya hanqethidosona.<verse eid="DEU 32:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 32:17"/>Xoosse gidonaysatas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:17">kase enti eronna xoossatas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:17">zine dendidaysatas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:17">enta aawati goyinniboona</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:17">xoossatas yarshidosona.<verse eid="DEU 32:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 32:18"/>Entaw de7o immiya Zaalla dogidosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:18">yelidi dichida Xoossa aggidosona.<verse eid="DEU 32:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 32:19"/>Adde naytinne macca nayti iya yiloyidosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:19">Goday hessa be7idi enta kadhis.<verse eid="DEU 32:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 32:20"/>I, “Enti geellanne ammanetona dere gidiya gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:20">taani ta som7uwa entafe genthana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:20">enta wursethaa si77i gada be7ana” yaagis.<verse eid="DEU 32:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 32:21"/>Xoosse gidonaysatan tana qanaatisidosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:21">banta eeqatan tana yiloyidosona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:21">Taani enta kadhetida asan qanaatisana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:21">eeya asan enta yiloyana.<verse eid="DEU 32:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 32:22"/>Ta hanqoy tamada eexana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:22">Si7oole gakanaw xuuggana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:22">Biittan de7iyaba ubbaa maana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:22">deriya baasuwa gakanaw xuuggana.<verse eid="DEU 32:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 32:23"/>“Taani enta bolla meto doorana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:23">ta dongiyan enta dukana.<verse eid="DEU 32:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 32:24"/>Ta enta bolla iita kosha yeddana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:24">enti hargeninne gadon wurana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:24">Enta bolla iita bazzo do7atanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:24">dukidi wodhiya iita shooshata yeddana.<verse eid="DEU 32:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 32:25"/>Enta, mashshi oge bolla wursana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:25">keetha garsan dagami kawotana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:25">Na7atetha addetinne maccati wurana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:25">guutha naytinne cimati attokona.<verse eid="DEU 32:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 32:26"/>Ta enta dhaysanawunne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:26">enta hassayiya asi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:26">doonna mela oothanaw qopas.<verse eid="DEU 32:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 32:27"/>Shin enta morketi, ‘Xooniday nuna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:27">ha ubbaa oothiday Godaa gidenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:27">yaagidi otoron ceeqetonna mela gada aggaagas’ ” yaagis.<verse eid="DEU 32:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 32:28"/>Isra7eele asay wozani bayna asi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:28">enti akeekokona.<verse eid="DEU 32:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 32:29"/>Enti cincidi akeekidako haysa erana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:29">banta wursethaka shaakanashin.<verse eid="DEU 32:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 32:30"/>Goday enta Xoossay enta bayzonaako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:30">enta medhida Wolqaamay aathidi immonaako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:30">waatidi issi asi mukulu asaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:30">num7u asi tammu mukulu asaa xoonii?<verse eid="DEU 32:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 32:31"/>Nu Zaallay nu morketa zaalla mela</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:31">gidonnaysa enti eroosona.<verse eid="DEU 32:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 32:32"/>Enta woyney Soodome woyniyape yees,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:32">enti Gamoora goshshan dolidosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:32">ayfiyan marzeynne camoy kumis.<verse eid="DEU 32:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 32:33"/>Enta woyney shoosha marze;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:33">wodhiya soggo.<verse eid="DEU 32:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 32:34"/>Goday, “Ta hessa dogadina?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:34">Ta mazgaben xaafabikina?<verse eid="DEU 32:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 32:35"/>Entaw dhayo gallasi matis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:35">enta bolla gakanabay ellesees.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:35">He wode enta tohoy dhubetana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:35">ta halo keyananne kushe zaarana.”<verse eid="DEU 32:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 32:36"/>Enta wolqay wuridaysanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:36">enta maaddiya asi baynaysa be7ida wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:36">Goday ba asaas pirdana; ba aylletas qadhetana.<verse eid="DEU 32:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 32:37"/>Xoossay entako, “Enti ammanetiya enta xoossati awunee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:37">Enti baqatidi qosetiya enta zaallay awunee?” yaagana.<verse eid="DEU 32:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 32:38"/>Enta modho yarshuwa midaysati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:38">enta woyne ushsha yarshuwa uydaysati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:38">ha77i dendidi enta maaddo; enta asho.<verse eid="DEU 32:38"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 32:39"/>“Tuma, Godi tana; Xoossi ta xalaala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:39">taape attishin, hara Xoossi baawa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:39">Wodheynne paathey tana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:39">ta madunxisayis; ta pathayis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:39">ta kushepe oonika ashshena.<verse eid="DEU 32:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 32:40"/>Ta kushiya denthada haysada yaagana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:40">Taani merinaw de7o;<verse eid="DEU 32:40"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 32:41"/>Phooliya ta mashsha leefada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:41">pirdanaw ta kushen oykiya wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:41">ta morketa bolla ta halo keyana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:41">tana ixeysatas kushe zaarana.<verse eid="DEU 32:41"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 32:42"/>Ta dongey enta suuthan mathotana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:42">ta mashshay enta ashuwa maana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:42">Tana ixiya ubbaa maarike;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:42">madunxidaysatinne di7etidaysati hayqana.”<verse eid="DEU 32:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 32:43"/>Kawotethato, Godaa asaara ufaytite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:43">I ba aylleta suutha accana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:43">Ba morketa bolla halo keyana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:43">biittan de7iya ba asaa nagaraa atto gaana.<verse eid="DEU 32:43"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 32:44"/>Museynne Nawe na7ay Iyyasuy Isra7eele asaa shiishidi, ha mazmuriya ubbaa asay si7ishin yexidosona.<verse eid="DEU 32:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 32:45"/>Musey ha qaala ubbaa Isra7eele asaas odi wursidaape guye, <verse eid="DEU 32:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 32:46"/>entako, “Ha higge qaala ubbaa hinte nayti naagana melanne kiitetana mela hachi ta hintew marka oothada immiya qaala ubbaa hinte wozanan wothite. <verse eid="DEU 32:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 32:47"/>Ha qaalay hintew de7ope attishin, coo qaala gidenna. Hinte ha qaala naagiko, Yordaanose pinnidi laattana biittan adussa laythi daana” yaagis.<verse eid="DEU 32:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 32:48"/>He gallas Goday Muse haysada yaagis; <verse eid="DEU 32:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 32:49"/>“Moo7aben, Iyaarko katamape sintha baggara de7iya Abariima Zumatape issuwa gidida Nabo Zuma bolla keya; yan Isra7eele asaa ta laatisana, Kanaane biitta haahon xeella. <verse eid="DEU 32:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 32:50"/>Ne ishaa Aaroni Hoora Zuma bolla hayqidi, ba mayzata gakidaysada neka ha zumaa bolla hayqada ne mayzata gakana. <verse eid="DEU 32:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 32:51"/>Hinte nam7ay Isra7eele asaa sinthan taw ammanetibeketa. Siina mela biittan, Qaadesa matan de7iya Mariba haatha matan ta geeshshatetha Isra7eele asaa bessibeketa. <verse eid="DEU 32:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 32:52"/>Hessa gisho, neeni he biitta haahon xeellanaape attishin, ta Isra7eele asaa laatisana biitta gelaka” yaagis.<verse eid="DEU 32:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 32"/>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="DEU 33"/>
  <para style="s1">Musey Isra7eele Kocha Anjis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 33:1"/>Xoossa asi gidida Musey hayqanaape sinthe, Isra7eele asaa anjida anjo qaalay haysa.<verse eid="DEU 33:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 33:2"/>Musey, “Goday Siina zumaape yis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:2">Sayre zumaape nu bolla poo7is.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:2">Paarana zumaape phoolis.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:2">Mukulan taybetiya kiitanchoti iyara de7oosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:2">Iya ushachan tama lacoy de7ees.<verse eid="DEU 33:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 33:3"/>Godaw neeni ne asaa dosadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:3">Geeshshati ubbay ne kushen de7oosona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:3">Ne tohuwa garsan ubbay gulbatidi goyinnoosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:3">neepe kiita ekoosona.<verse eid="DEU 33:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 33:4"/>Musey immida higgiya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:4">Isra7eele asaa laata ekoosona.<verse eid="DEU 33:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 33:5"/>Isra7eele zerethati deriya halaqatara shiiqida wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:5">Goday ba asaa, Isra7eele bolla kawotis.<verse eid="DEU 33:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 33:6"/>“Robeela kochay taybon guutha gidikoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:6">I hayqofo; paxa de7o.”<verse eid="DEU 33:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 33:7"/>Musey Yihuda kochaaba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:7">“Godaw, Yihuda waasuwa si7a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:7">hanko iya yaratara iya bu7a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:7">Enta kushiya minthetha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:7">enti banta morketara oletiya wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:7">enta maadda.<verse eid="DEU 33:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 33:8"/>Musey Leewe kochaaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:8">ne Tumiimeynne Uriimey,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:8">neeni Masahan paacidanne Mariban palamida,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:8">ne geeshsha asaasa.<verse eid="DEU 33:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 33:9"/>Bantana yelidaysatape,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:9">banta ishatapenne banta naytape aathidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:9">enti new ammanetidosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:9">ne caaqo qaala naagidosona.<verse eid="DEU 33:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 33:10"/>Enti ne wogaa Yayqooba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:10">ne higgiya Isra7eele tamaarsoosona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:10">Enti ne sinthan ixaane cuyisoosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:10">yarsho bessan xuussa yarsho yarshoosona.<verse eid="DEU 33:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 33:11"/>Abeeti Godaw, Leeweta anja;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:11">enta kushe oosuwan ne ufayta.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:11">Enta bolla dendiya morketa mentheretha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:11">zaari dendonna mela enta morketa cadda.”<verse eid="DEU 33:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 33:12"/>Biniyaame kochaaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:12">“Godan dosetiday iyan ammanetidi de7ees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:12">qamma gallas I enta naagees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:12">ba hashiyan tookidi shempisees.”<verse eid="DEU 33:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 33:13"/>Yoosefa kochaaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:13">“Goday, salope iran,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:13">sa7ape pulto haathan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:13">enta biitta anjo.<verse eid="DEU 33:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 33:14"/>Awan kaxidi dooretida ayfeninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:14">woden woden kaxiya ayfen anjeto.<verse eid="DEU 33:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 33:15"/>Benipe de7iya deretinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:15">zumati lo77o ayfen anjeto.<verse eid="DEU 33:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 33:16"/>Enta biittay lo77obay kumida biitta gido;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:16">tushiya giddon eexiya taman qoncida Goday iya anjo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:16">Ha anjoti ubbay Yoosefa kochaa gako;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:16">I ba ishata giddon halaqa gido.<verse eid="DEU 33:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 33:17"/>Yoosefi koyro yeletida kormada mino;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:17">iya kaceti mentha kaceda mino.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:17">Iya kaceti tammu mukulan taybetiya Efreema kochata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:17">mukulun taybetiya Minaase kochata.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:17">He kacetan I kawotethata qaycana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:17">biitta gaxaa gakanaw I enta sugana.”<verse eid="DEU 33:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 33:18"/>Zabloona kochaaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:18">“Zabloona, neeni ne kessan ufayta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:18">Yisaakora, neeni ne dunkaaniyan ufayta.<verse eid="DEU 33:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 33:19"/>Enti asaa banta zumako xeegana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:19">yan enti geeshshatetha yarsho yarshana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:19">Banta aquwanne banta duretetha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:19">abbaafenne abba gaxan de7iya shafiyape demmana” yaagis.<verse eid="DEU 33:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 33:20"/>Gaade kochaaba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:20">“Enta biitta dalgisida Goday galatetto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:20">Gaadi morke som7o woyko qese menthanaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:20">gaammoda naagees.<verse eid="DEU 33:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 33:21"/>Enti lo77o biitta bantaw dooridosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:21">halaqatas gida biitta enti ekidosona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:21">Isra7eele halaqati shiiqida wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:21">Godaa geeshsha sheniya shaakidi eridosona</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:21">Isra7eeles suure pirdaa pirdidosona” yaagis.<verse eid="DEU 33:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 33:22"/>Daane kochaaba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:22">“Daaney wodala gaammo mela;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:22">I Baasanepe gupidi keyana” yaagis.<verse eid="DEU 33:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 33:23"/>Niftaaleme kochaaba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:23">“Niftaalemey Godaa aadho keehatethan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:23">iya anjuwan duretis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:23">enta biittay Abbaafe dugeha bagga gakees” yaagis.<verse eid="DEU 33:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 33:24"/>Aseera kochaaba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:24">“Aseeri hara kochatape aadhidi anjetidaysa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:24">ba ishatan dosetidaysa gido;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:24">iya biittay shamaho zayten dureto.<verse eid="DEU 33:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 33:25"/>Iya katamati birata pengen gordetidi naageto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:25">ba laytha ubban I wolqaama gido.<verse eid="DEU 33:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 33:26"/>Isra7eele, salope nena maaddanaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:26">ba gitatethan shaara bolla hemetiya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:26">ne Xoossaa mela xoossi oonee?<verse eid="DEU 33:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 33:27"/>Merinaa Xoossay ne de7iya bessi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:27">iya merinaa kusheti neepe garsara de7oosona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:27">I ne morketa ne sinthafe kessidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:27">‘enta dhaysa’ yaagis.<verse eid="DEU 33:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 33:28"/>Hessa gisho, Isra7eele kochay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:28">salo iray bukiya bessan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:28">kathinne woyney kumida biittan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:28">hirgi bayna saro daana.<verse eid="DEU 33:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 33:29"/>Isra7eele, ne anjetadaysa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:29">Goday ashshida ne meli oonee?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:29">I new gondallenne maaddiya mashsha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:29">ne morketi ne sinthan gufannana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:29">ne enta baasuwa laallana” yaagis.<verse eid="DEU 33:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 33"/>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="DEU 34"/>
  <para style="s1">Muse Hayquwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 34:1"/>Musey Moo7abe dembaafe dendidi, Nabo zuma huuphiya, qassi Iyaarkofe doloha baggara de7iya Pisga zuma huuphiya gakis. Yan Goday Daane gakanaw de7iya Galada biitta, <verse eid="DEU 34:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 34:2"/>Niftaaleme biitta ubbaa, Efreemenne Minaase biitta, wuloha baggara bidi Medetiraane Abbaa gakanaw de7iya Yihuda biittanne <verse eid="DEU 34:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 34:3"/>dugeha baggara Zo7aarepe dendidi, zambi de7iya Iyaarko katamaa, zangaaran de7iya demba ubbaa bessis. <verse eid="DEU 34:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 34:4"/>Goday Museko, “Taani hinte sheeshas immana gada Abrahaames, Yisaaqasinne Yayqoobas, caaqida biittay haysa. Ha77i neeni ne ayfen be7ana mela oothas, shin neeni yaa pinnaka” yaagis.<verse eid="DEU 34:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 34:5"/>Godaa aylley, Musey, Goday gidaysada, yan Moo7abe biittan hayqis. <verse eid="DEU 34:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 34:6"/>Goday Beet-Pa7oora katamaape sintha baggan Moo7abe zangaaran iya moogis. Shin hachi gakanaw I moogetida duufuwa eriya asi baawa. <verse eid="DEU 34:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 34:7"/>Musey hayqiya wode iyaw laythi xeetanne laatama; shin iya ayfey ixibeenna; iya wolqay daaburibeenna. <verse eid="DEU 34:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 34:8"/>Isra7eele asay Moo7abe denban hastamu gallas Muses yeekidosona. Hessafe guye, baley dendin, yeeho wodey wuris.<verse eid="DEU 34:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 34:9"/>Musey, ba bessan oothana mela, iya bolla ba kushiya wothida gisho, Nawe na7ay Iyyasuy cincatetha ayyaanan kumis. Isra7eele asay Iyyasus kiitetidosona; Goday Muse baggara immida kiita naagidosona.<verse eid="DEU 34:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 34:10"/>Godaa som7on odisida, Muse mela nabey, Isra7eele biittan dendibeenna. <verse eid="DEU 34:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 34:11"/>Goday Muse Gibxe kawako, iyara oothiya moorinnatakonne kumetha asaako yeddidi, iya baggara malaatatanne malaalsiyabata ubbaa oothida, Muse mela hara nabey oonika baawa. <verse eid="DEU 34:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 34:12"/>Isra7eele ubbaa sinthan gita wolqan malaalsiyaba oothida, Muse mela asi oonika baawa.<verse eid="DEU 34:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 34"/>
</usx>
